docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"Rust 工作区职责、目录发现、引用和调用方向。","locale":"zh-CN"},"9":{"id":"/docs/architecture-1","page_id":"/docs/architecture","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/architecture#解包与发布","content":"解包与发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"10":{"id":"/docs/architecture-2","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"`src/main.rs` 负责解析和退出，`src/cli/` 定义命令树和各命令参数，`src/commands/` 执行命令并输出结果，`src/config.rs` 将配置解析成显式类型并保存来源诊断。库的安装选项是显式输入，不自行读取用户全局配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"11":{"id":"/docs/architecture-3","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"全部代码位于同一个 `hanamori` crate，顶层模块按层组织，只能依赖下层：","locale":"zh-CN"},"12":{"id":"/docs/architecture-4","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"层","locale":"zh-CN"},"13":{"id":"/docs/architecture-5","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"模块","locale":"zh-CN"},"14":{"id":"/docs/architecture-6","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"职责","locale":"zh-CN"},"15":{"id":"/docs/architecture-7","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"可依赖","locale":"zh-CN"},"16":{"id":"/docs/architecture-8","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"foundation","locale":"zh-CN"},"17":{"id":"/docs/architecture-9","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"`env`、`msbuild`、`file_usage`、`fs`、`identity`、`locking`、`serde_helpers`、`version`","locale":"zh-CN"},"18":{"id":"/docs/architecture-10","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"路径、锁、文件占用处理、布局、版本与产品身份","locale":"zh-CN"},"19":{"id":"/docs/architecture-11","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/d