tion","locale":"zh-CN"},"45":{"id":"/docs/architecture-37","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"`cli`、`commands`、`config`、`logging`、`runtime`、`self_uninstall`、`upgrade`","locale":"zh-CN"},"46":{"id":"/docs/architecture-38","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"命令行、配置、自我更新与自身卸载","locale":"zh-CN"},"47":{"id":"/docs/architecture-39","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"所有层","locale":"zh-CN"},"48":{"id":"/docs/architecture-40","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"未发布的 `test-support` crate 提供合成负载、HTTP fixture 与 Shell 测试支持。`cargo xtask check` 在 CI 中检查结构：","locale":"zh-CN"},"49":{"id":"/docs/architecture-41","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"任意层级的同级模块之间不得循环依赖，其他平台的代码同样检查，仅测试代码除外；","locale":"zh-CN"},"50":{"id":"/docs/architecture-42","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"顶层模块遵守上表的依赖方向；","locale":"zh-CN"},"51":{"id":"/docs/architecture-43","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"父模块（`lib.rs` 和任何带子模块的文件）只包含 `mod` 声明和重新导出，实现位于叶子模块。","locale":"zh-CN"},"52":{"id":"/docs/architecture-44","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"`upgrade` 与 `self_uninstall` 模块提供 GitHub 自我更新与自身卸载编排。网站是独立 `site/` Bun 项目，不加入 Rust 程序运行依赖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"53":{"id":"/docs/architecture-45","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"`file_usage` 独立封装 Windows Restart Manager，支持单文件和目录树。安装替换、残留目录清理、工具链卸载、缓存清理、自更新备份和自身卸载元数据删除共用它；调用方仍负责操作锁和预览流程。模块不跟随链接，不关闭自身进程，其他平台沿用普通文件操作。","locale":"zh-CN"},"54":{"id":"/docs/architecture-46","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"每套托管组合独占 `<toolchains-dir>/<来源>/msvc-<下载 ID>_sdk-<下载 ID 或 none>_host-<host>_target-<target>`。本地命令扫描目录并检查少量必要文件；目录名保存下载 ID，实际 MSVC/SDK 版本从解包结构读取。自定义来源以清单 URL 的稳定 SHA-256 区分，不因清单内容更新改变目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"55":{"id":"/docs/architecture-47","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"MSBuild 组合在 `_host-<host>_target-<target>` 前加入 `_msbuild-<版本>`。`catalog/msbuild` 维护 VS 2022/2026 C++ 所需的明确包集合；不递归安装任意 VS 依赖。负载带 toolset/SDK/MSBuild 角色，FileTracker MSI 独立解包并整理到私有引擎目录。`msbuild` 模块从源模板生成安装内的 props/targets，保存引擎包版本并定义关键文件检查；不修改上游 targets，不写注册表，不运行系统安装器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"56":{"id":"/docs/architecture-48","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture","content":"`references/<name>.json` 只保存名字指向的托管目录键，或外部路径与固定版本组合。引用不证明安装存在；损坏的单个引用不会遮蔽其他安装。安装数据库、文件收据与 JSON 恢复日志已移除。配置/项目声明仍为 schema 1，Shell 启动入口的归属记录继续保留。验收方法见测试与原生验收。","locale":"zh-CN"},"57":{"id":"/docs/architecture-49","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#解包与发布","content":"VSIX 打开时统一识别编译器目录版本、规范化输出路径并统计文件，解包复用这些元数据，直接流式写入安装事务的私有暂存树。MSI 的文件、目录、组件和介质映射也在准备阶段解析一次，供计数和解包共用；下载 CAB 前仍需先读取 MSI 的介质表。","locale":"zh-CN"},"58":{"id":"/docs/architecture-50","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#解包与发布","content":"CAB 按压缩文件夹中的偏移顺序连续读取，多个文件复用同一解压器，避免每提取一个文件都从头解压。后端固定为提供文件夹读取接口的 `cab-superewald 0.6.1`，保留原有 Stored、MSZIP 和 LZX 解码支持。每次只打开一个 CAB，文件内容不再整体缓存在内存中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"59":{"id":"/docs/architecture-51","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#解包与发布","content":"SDK 中间目录位于安装事务内，整理 `Windows Kits` 时在同一卷移动，避免下载临时目录和安装目录跨盘时复制整个 SDK。解包失败由事务丢弃暂存树，不为每个文件创建临时文件或处理已运行编译器的文件占用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"60":{"id":"/docs/architecture-52","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#解包与发布","content":"下载负载校验、归档自带校验和输出路径检查保留。发布前检查实际版本与必要编译器、头文件和库，不生成全文件清单或遍历计算安装文件哈希。","locale":"zh-CN"},"61":{"id":"/docs/architecture-53","page_id":"/docs/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/architecture#解包与发布","content":"安装持有目标目录锁，在同卷 `.<目录名>.stage` 中准备新树，成功后将旧树改名为 `.old`，再发布新树并清理旧树。准备失败保留旧目录；下次安装清理中断残留，必要时先把 `.old` 还原。普通复用也经过此清理流程。托管目录缺失或必要文件不全时重新安装；任意其他损坏用 `--reinstall` 整体替换。","locale":"zh-CN"},"62":{"id":"/docs/bash-zsh","page_id":"/docs/bash-zsh","type":"page","content":"Bash 与 Zsh","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","Shell 集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/bash-zsh","locale":"zh-CN"},"63":{"id":"/docs/bash-zsh-0","page_id":"/docs/bash-zsh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/bash-zsh","content":"加载钩子，处理 Windows 原生路径和登录启动文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"64":{"id":"/docs/bash-zsh-1","page_id":"/docs/bash-zsh","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/bash-zsh#windows-路径","content":"Windows 路径","locale":"zh-CN"},"65":{"id":"/docs/bash-zsh-2","page_id":"/docs/bash-zsh","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/bash-zsh#持久入口","content":"持久入口","locale":"zh-CN"},"66":{"id":"/docs/bash-zsh-3","page_id":"/docs/bash-zsh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/bash-zsh","content":"不指定 `--shell` 时自动检测当前 Shell。显式脚本输出请使用与加载它的 Shell 一致的 `--shell bash` 或 `--shell zsh`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"67":{"id":"/docs/bash-zsh-4","page_id":"/docs/bash-zsh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/bash-zsh#windows-路径","content":"Windows 原生程序返回的 `D:\\Tools\\hanamori.exe` 不是 POSIX 命令路径。生成的钩子在当前 MSYS 运行时中调用 `cygpath -u` 后再执行。必须保留可用的 `cygpath` 在 PATH；转换失败即停止，不继续调用错误路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"68":{"id":"/docs/bash-zsh-5","page_id":"/docs/bash-zsh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/bash-zsh#windows-路径","content":"更新旧钩子时，直接调用新程序重新执行 `env` 并加载，或者使用 `shell init` 更新持久入口。例如在 Git Bash/Zsh 中调用 `/d/Tools/hanamori.exe`。包含空格的程序路径要加引号。编译器消费的 INCLUDE/LIB 仍是 Windows 格式，不能把全部变量统一改成 POSIX 路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"69":{"id":"/docs/bash-zsh-6","page_id":"/docs/bash-zsh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/bash-zsh#持久入口","content":"默认 Bash 配置维护 `.bashrc` 和实际登录入口的桥接，避免登录/非登录终端重复执行用户设置；没有可用登录文件时创建低优先级 `.profile`。撤销可删除由 Hanamori 创建且撤销后为空的登录文件，保留用户添加的内容。Zsh 使用 `ZDOTDIR` 指定的位置；显式 `--profile` 优先。","locale":"zh-CN"},"70":{"id":"/docs/bash-zsh-7","page_id":"/docs/bash-zsh","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/bash-zsh#持久入口","content":"这些 Shell 的支持不等同于在 Linux/macOS 原生执行 MSVC。当前编译支持范围见平台说明。","locale":"zh-CN"},"71":{"id":"/docs/build","page_id":"/docs/build","type":"page","content":"获取程序与源码构建","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/build","locale":"zh-CN"},"72":{"id":"/docs/build-0","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build","content":"一键安装 Hanamori、下载便携程序，或从源码构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"73":{"id":"/docs/build-1","page_id":"/docs/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"一键安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"74":{"id":"/docs/build-2","page_id":"/docs/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/build#msys2-与-git-bash","content":"MSYS2 与 Git Bash","locale":"zh-CN"},"75":{"id":"/docs/build-3","page_id":"/docs/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/build#便携安装","content":"便携安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"76":{"id":"/docs/build-4","page_id":"/docs/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/build#从源码构建","content":"从源码构建","locale":"zh-CN"},"77":{"id":"/docs/build-5","page_id":"/docs/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/build#arm64-程序版本","content":"ARM64 程序版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"78":{"id":"/docs/build-6","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"在 Windows x64 / ARM64 的 PowerShell 5.1 或 PowerShell 7 中运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"79":{"id":"/docs/build-7","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"默认下载最新稳定版，验证 SHA-256、大小和程序版本后，安装到 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Hanamori\\bin\\hanamori.exe`，配置用户 PATH、当前 PowerShell 的启动 Hook 与补全。无需管理员权限，也不下载工具链。命令直接在当前 PowerShell 执行时立即生效；从子进程执行安装后需要打开新终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"80":{"id":"/docs/build-8","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"指定版本或安装目录时，将脚本作为带参数的脚本块执行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"81":{"id":"/docs/build-9","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"也可以通过 `HANAMORI_INSTALL_DIR` 设置存放 `hanamori.exe` 的目录：","locale":"zh-CN"},"82":{"id":"/docs/build-10","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"安装路径优先级为 `-InstallDir` → `HANAMORI_INSTALL_DIR` → `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Hanamori\\bin`。环境变量未设置或为空时使用默认目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"83":{"id":"/docs/build-11","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"84":{"id":"/docs/build-12","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"85":{"id":"/docs/build-13","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"`-Version`","locale":"zh-CN"},"86":{"id":"/docs/build-14","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"`latest` 或指定版本，可带 `v` 前缀","locale":"zh-CN"},"87":{"id":"/docs/build-15","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"`-InstallDir`","locale":"zh-CN"},"88":{"id":"/docs/build-16","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"存放 `hanamori.exe` 的目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"89":{"id":"/docs/build-17","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"`-NoPathUpdate`","locale":"zh-CN"},"90":{"id":"/docs/build-18","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"跳过用户和当前进程 PATH 配置","locale":"zh-CN"},"91":{"id":"/docs/build-19","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"`-NoShell`","locale":"zh-CN"},"92":{"id":"/docs/build-20","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"跳过当前 PowerShell 的持久与会话集成","locale":"zh-CN"},"93":{"id":"/docs/build-21","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"重复运行会替换程序并复用已有配置；下载或验证失败时保留旧程序。`HANAMORI_HOME` 仍控制管理器数据目录，不控制程序安装目录。脚本保留原有 PATH 和 Profile 内容，不修改执行策略；受策略限制的 Profile 会给出提示。其他 Shell 可按 Shell 集成 配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"94":{"id":"/docs/build-22","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#一键安装","content":"安装完成后按需运行 `hanamori install latest --name stable` 安装工具链。之后使用 `hanamori upgrade` 更新本体，使用 `hanamori self uninstall` 卸载。卸载命令会根据程序旁的 `.install.json` 记录清理脚本添加的 PATH 条目。","locale":"zh-CN"},"95":{"id":"/docs/build-23","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#msys2-与-git-bash","content":"在 Windows x64 / ARM64 的 MSYS2 或 Git Bash 中运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"96":{"id":"/docs/build-24","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#msys2-与-git-bash","content":"脚本复用 PowerShell 安装器下载和验证程序、配置用户 PATH，并通过 `hanamori shell init --shell bash` 为实际运行脚本的 Bash 配置 `.bashrc`、登录入口与补全。默认安装目录为 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Hanamori\\bin`，不下载工具链，也不修改 PowerShell Profile。","locale":"zh-CN"},"97":{"id":"/docs/build-25","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#msys2-与-git-bash","content":"需要 `cygpath`、`curl` 和 Windows PowerShell 或 PowerShell 7。MSYS2 未将 PowerShell 加入 PATH 时，会从 Windows 系统目录查找。仓库内可直接运行 `bash install.sh`，使用同目录的 `install.ps1`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"98":{"id":"/docs/build-26","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#msys2-与-git-bash","content":"参数为 `--version`、`--install-dir`、`--no-path-update` 和 `--no-shell`；安装目录支持 MSYS 路径和 Windows 路径。`--no-shell` 跳过 Bash 启动文件与补全配置，`--no-path-update` 跳过用户 PATH 配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"99":{"id":"/docs/build-27","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#msys2-与-git-bash","content":"Bash 同样支持 `HANAMORI_INSTALL_DIR`，`--install-dir` 优先于环境变量。变量未设置或为空时使用默认目录；管道安装时将变量传给 `bash`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"100":{"id":"/docs/build-28","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#msys2-与-git-bash","content":"`curl | bash` 运行在子进程中。安装后重开 Bash，或执行脚本输出的 Hook 加载命令，让当前终端立即使用 Hanamori。MSYS2 启动时可能重新组织 PATH；Bash Hook 通过程序的绝对路径调用 Hanamori。","locale":"zh-CN"},"101":{"id":"/docs/build-29","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#便携安装","content":"首先查看下载页。发布流程为 x64 和 ARM64 分别提供 EXE 与 ZIP：`hanamori-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.*` 与 `hanamori-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.*`，ZIP 内的程序为 `hanamori.exe`。直接下载 EXE 后可以改名为 `hanamori.exe`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"102":{"id":"/docs/build-30","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#便携安装","content":"将程序放在自己的工具目录，例如 `D:\\Tools\\Hanamori`。临时在 PowerShell 添加 PATH：","locale":"zh-CN"},"103":{"id":"/docs/build-31","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#便携安装","content":"需要持久 PATH 时，在 Windows 的用户环境变量设置中加入该目录，然后重开终端。`shell init` 配置启动钩子，不负责给系统 PATH 安装程序。程序是便携的，不需要 Visual Studio、aria2c 或 msiexec 来运行安装器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"104":{"id":"/docs/build-32","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#从源码构建","content":"构建需要 Rust 工具链以及对应目标的链接器和构建依赖；运行已构建的安装器不需要 Rust。","locale":"zh-CN"},"105":{"id":"/docs/build-33","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#从源码构建","content":"Windows 上输出为 `target/release/hanamori.exe`。发行流程使用 `x86_64-pc-windows-msvc` / `aarch64-pc-windows-msvc` 目标，输出在 `target/<目标>/release/`。程序自我更新支持这两个目标；GNU 或 Unix 构建不会获得该更新资产。开发与验收见架构、测试和发布流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"106":{"id":"/docs/build-34","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#arm64-程序版本","content":"安装脚本根据 Windows 原生架构选择程序，即使从仿真 Shell 启动也是如此。PowerShell 可用 `-Architecture x64` / `-Architecture arm64`，Bash 可用 `--architecture x64` / `--architecture arm64` 覆盖。该参数选择 Hanamori 本身；`hanamori install --arch HOST/TARGET` 独立选择编译工具链。","locale":"zh-CN"},"107":{"id":"/docs/build-35","page_id":"/docs/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/build#arm64-程序版本","content":"ARM64 发布包含 `hanamori-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.exe` 和 `.zip`，ZIP 内为 `hanamori.exe`。源码构建使用 `cargo build --release --target aarch64-pc-windows-msvc`，并准备相应的 MSVC 链接器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"108":{"id":"/docs/cache","page_id":"/docs/cache","type":"page","content":"下载、缓存与代理","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","维护与参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cache","locale":"zh-CN"},"109":{"id":"/docs/cache-0","page_id":"/docs/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cache","content":"区分完整 payload 缓存和可续传下载工作区。","locale":"zh-CN"},"110":{"id":"/docs/cache-1","page_id":"/docs/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cache","content":"完整负载按 SHA-256 内容寻址保存，只有通过验证的下载才能进入缓存；损坏条目重新获取。不同独立安装可复用完整负载，但不会共享已安装 SDK 目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"111":{"id":"/docs/cache-2","page_id":"/docs/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cache","content":"`--download-dir` 指定的是独立的持久下载工作区，用于未完成、可续传的下载。它不是完整缓存。默认工作区是临时的，设置 `--cache-dir` 不会自动保留未完成片段。","locale":"zh-CN"},"112":{"id":"/docs/cache-3","page_id":"/docs/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cache","content":"`--file-workers` 限制并行 payload 数，`--connections` 限制每个 payload 的连接数。默认分别为 4 和 8。`--mirror` 替换负载主机/基础路径，失败时回退到原始 URL。具体字段及来源优先级见配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"113":{"id":"/docs/cache-4","page_id":"/docs/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cache","content":"清理只处理固定 SHA-256 命名空间中可识别的完整文件；保留未知文件、部分下载、目录和锁。被其他 Hanamori 操作锁定的条目会跳过。Windows 上取得缓存锁后，若删除因文件占用失败，会通过 Windows Restart Manager 关闭使用该文件的进程并重试。部分失败返回非零状态并报告已处理项，可解决占用后重试。不改变工具链或引用或持久下载工作区。预览不取锁、不写文件、不关闭进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"114":{"id":"/docs/cache-5","page_id":"/docs/cache","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cache","content":"自我更新使用 GitHub API 与 Release 资产，使用同一 proxy 配置，但不使用工具链 mirror、cache 或 download-dir。","locale":"zh-CN"},"115":{"id":"/docs/cli","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"page","content":"命令参考","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","维护与参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli","locale":"zh-CN"},"116":{"id":"/docs/cli-0","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"全部公开命令的参数、默认值、冲突和输出约定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"117":{"id":"/docs/cli-1","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"全局选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"118":{"id":"/docs/cli-2","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"安装和远端查询","locale":"zh-CN"},"119":{"id":"/docs/cli-3","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#本地目录和选择","content":"本地目录和选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"120":{"id":"/docs/cli-4","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"Shell 命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"121":{"id":"/docs/cli-5","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"生命周期与清理","locale":"zh-CN"},"122":{"id":"/docs/cli-6","page_id":"/docs/cli","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/cli#输出约定","content":"输出约定","locale":"zh-CN"},"123":{"id":"/docs/cli-7","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli","content":"本页对应当前源码的 Clap 定义。命令之间的环境与目录管理语义见各功能页。`hanamori --help`、`hanamori COMMAND --help` 是已安装版本的实际接口；程序不提供 `run` 别名。","locale":"zh-CN"},"124":{"id":"/docs/cli-8","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#全局选项","content":"所有公开命令可接收 `--manager-dir PATH`、`--toolchains-dir PATH`、`--cache-dir PATH`、`--download-dir PATH`、`--proxy URL`、`--mirror URL`、`--file-workers N`、`--connections N`、`--log FILTER`。只解析命令实际消费的配置。默认值、范围和环境映射详见配置表。`-h/--help` 打印帮助，顶层 `-V/--version` 打印程序版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"125":{"id":"/docs/cli-9","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"默认安装 MSVC + Windows SDK + MSBuild。安装帮助按目标目录、版本与组件、安装行为、清单来源分组。","locale":"zh-CN"},"126":{"id":"/docs/cli-10","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"127":{"id":"/docs/cli-11","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"参数与行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"128":{"id":"/docs/cli-12","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`install [VERSION]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"129":{"id":"/docs/cli-13","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"VERSION 为托管目录键、实际版本/前缀或 latest；无显式约束时选择渠道最新，项目可提供约束","locale":"zh-CN"},"130":{"id":"/docs/cli-14","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--dir/-d PATH`","locale":"zh-CN"},"131":{"id":"/docs/cli-15","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"指定精确最终目录，替代默认独立管理目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"132":{"id":"/docs/cli-16","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--name ALIAS`","locale":"zh-CN"},"133":{"id":"/docs/cli-17","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"为安装创建固定别名，不激活，不改变 default","locale":"zh-CN"},"134":{"id":"/docs/cli-18","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--toolset-id ID`","locale":"zh-CN"},"135":{"id":"/docs/cli-19","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"精确下载 ID，与位置 VERSION 互斥","locale":"zh-CN"},"136":{"id":"/docs/cli-20","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--sdk VER`","locale":"zh-CN"},"137":{"id":"/docs/cli-21","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"实际 SDK 版本，与 `--sdk-id`、`--no-sdk` 互斥","locale":"zh-CN"},"138":{"id":"/docs/cli-22","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--sdk-id ID`","locale":"zh-CN"},"139":{"id":"/docs/cli-23","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"SDK 下载 ID，与 `--sdk`、`--no-sdk` 互斥","locale":"zh-CN"},"140":{"id":"/docs/cli-24","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--no-sdk`","locale":"zh-CN"},"141":{"id":"/docs/cli-25","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"不安装 SDK，默认也不安装 MSBuild；项目明确要求 MSBuild 时须同时加 `--no-msbuild`","locale":"zh-CN"},"142":{"id":"/docs/cli-26","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--msbuild`","locale":"zh-CN"},"143":{"id":"/docs/cli-27","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"显式启用 MSBuild，覆盖项目设置；默认随 SDK 安装，支持 VS 2022 v143 和 VS 2026 v145；与 `--no-sdk`、`--no-msbuild` 互斥","locale":"zh-CN"},"144":{"id":"/docs/cli-28","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--no-msbuild`","locale":"zh-CN"},"145":{"id":"/docs/cli-29","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"禁用默认启用的 MSBuild，也覆盖项目要求；默认保留编译器与 SDK","locale":"zh-CN"},"146":{"id":"/docs/cli-30","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--reinstall`","locale":"zh-CN"},"147":{"id":"/docs/cli-31","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"整体重新安装；外部非空目录必须显式指定","locale":"zh-CN"},"148":{"id":"/docs/cli-32","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--arch ARCH`","locale":"zh-CN"},"149":{"id":"/docs/cli-33","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`x64/x64`、`x64/arm64`、`arm64/x64`、`arm64/arm64`；显式参数 → 项目 → Windows 原生架构","locale":"zh-CN"},"150":{"id":"/docs/cli-34","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--dry-run`","locale":"zh-CN"},"151":{"id":"/docs/cli-35","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"可以查询清单，不下载负载，不写安装/引用/工作区","locale":"zh-CN"},"152":{"id":"/docs/cli-36","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`list-remote`","locale":"zh-CN"},"153":{"id":"/docs/cli-37","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"默认查询 VS 2026；`--all` 同时查询 VS 2022/2026；可加 `--toolset-id ID` 查看指定工具集的包；支持 `--json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"154":{"id":"/docs/cli-38","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"这两个命令共用 `--vs-version 2022/2026`（别名 17/18，默认 2026）、`--channel release/preview`（别名 stable/insiders，默认 release）、`--manifest URL`（与前两者互斥）和 `--strict-manifest-integrity`。install 不支持 `--json`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"155":{"id":"/docs/cli-39","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`list-remote --all` 按 VS 2022、VS 2026 分组列出所选渠道中的工具集和 SDK，并分别展开各组最新工具集的包。默认查询正式渠道；加 `--channel preview`（或 `insiders`）查询两者的预览渠道，不同时混入正式渠道。同名 ID 保留在各自来源组中。它与 `--vs-version`、`--manifest`、`--toolset-id` 互斥。这里的“全部”指当前支持的两代 VS 所选渠道中仍提供的版本，不保证覆盖微软历史上所有已撤下的版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"156":{"id":"/docs/cli-40","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#安装和远端查询","content":"`--all --json` 输出 `{ \"catalogs\": [...] }`；每组包含 `vs_version`、`channel`、`manifest_url`，以及单源查询已有的 `toolsets`、`sdks`、`selected_toolset_id` 和 `packages`。任意来源查询失败会使整个命令失败，不输出部分列表；默认警告/严格清单校验策略对两个来源均生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"157":{"id":"/docs/cli-41","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#本地目录和选择","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"158":{"id":"/docs/cli-42","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#本地目录和选择","content":"参数与结果","locale":"zh-CN"},"159":{"id":"/docs/cli-43","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#本地目录和选择","content":"`list [--json]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"160":{"id":"/docs/cli-44","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#本地目录和选择","content":"目录扫描结果、别名、实际版本和可用性，不联网","locale":"zh-CN"},"161":{"id":"/docs/cli-45","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#本地目录和选择","content":"`current [--json]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"162":{"id":"/docs/cli-46","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#本地目录和选择","content":"当前会话固定快照，不重选 default/项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"163":{"id":"/docs/cli-47","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#本地目录和选择","content":"`alias [SELECTOR NAME] [--json]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"164":{"id":"/docs/cli-48","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#本地目录和选择","content":"两个位置参数一同提供时赋值；否则列出映射","locale":"zh-CN"},"165":{"i