目录版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"177":{"id":"/docs/cli-61","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"178":{"id":"/docs/cli-62","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"179":{"id":"/docs/cli-63","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`completions`","locale":"zh-CN"},"180":{"id":"/docs/cli-64","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`--shell/-s SHELL`、`--output/-o PATH`；生成补全，不加载工具链钩子","locale":"zh-CN"},"181":{"id":"/docs/cli-65","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`env`","locale":"zh-CN"},"182":{"id":"/docs/cli-66","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`--shell/-s SHELL`、`--output/-o PATH`、`--auto-activate`、`--use-on-cd`、`--completions`，以及钩子工具链目录默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"183":{"id":"/docs/cli-67","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`shell init`","locale":"zh-CN"},"184":{"id":"/docs/cli-68","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`--shell/-s`、`--profile PATH` 或 `--shell-executable PATH`、`--auto-activate`、`--use-on-cd`、`--completions`、`--dry-run`、钩子工具链目录默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"185":{"id":"/docs/cli-69","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`shell deinit`","locale":"zh-CN"},"186":{"id":"/docs/cli-70","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`--shell/-s`、`--profile` 或 `--shell-executable`、`--dry-run`","locale":"zh-CN"},"187":{"id":"/docs/cli-71","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`shell activate [SELECTOR]`","locale":"zh-CN"},"188":{"id":"/docs/cli-72","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"直接目录选项、`--shell/-s`、`--output/-o` 或 `--plain`","locale":"zh-CN"},"189":{"id":"/docs/cli-73","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`shell deactivate`","locale":"zh-CN"},"190":{"id":"/docs/cli-74","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`--shell/-s`、`--output/-o`","locale":"zh-CN"},"191":{"id":"/docs/cli-75","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"SHELL 为 `powershell`、`bash`、`zsh`、`cmd`；省略时检测调用 Shell。`--plain` 不检测，且与 shell/output 互斥。profile 与 shell-executable 互斥，CMD 均不接受它们。","locale":"zh-CN"},"192":{"id":"/docs/cli-76","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"钩子工具链目录默认值使用 `--dir PATH`（此处没有 `-d`）、`--toolset VER`、`--sdk VER` 或 `--no-sdk`；后三者要求 dir，sdk/no-sdk 互斥。管理目录统一按每次命令的 `--manager-dir` → `HANAMORI_HOME` → 平台默认目录选择，生成钩子、补全或初始化脚本时不会保存管理目录。输出默认 stdout；CMD 如写入文件，路径必须以 `.cmd/.bat` 结尾。内部 dispatch/run 子命令供钩子使用，不作为用户接口。","locale":"zh-CN"},"193":{"id":"/docs/cli-77","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#shell-命令","content":"`completions`、`env --completions` 和 `shell init --completions` 仅支持 PowerShell、Bash、Zsh；CMD 明确报错。补全默认关闭，只读取管理器及工具链存储路径相关配置、不联网；Zsh 必须先加载 `compinit`。本地选择器、已有别名及指定目录下的组件版本会动态补全，遵循当前命令和环境的管理目录选择。固定取值、路径和 PowerShell 的能力差异见终端补全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"194":{"id":"/docs/cli-78","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"195":{"id":"/docs/cli-79","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"必要参数与可选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"196":{"id":"/docs/cli-80","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`import`","locale":"zh-CN"},"197":{"id":"/docs/cli-81","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"必须 `--dir/-d PATH --name NAME`；可选 `--toolset`、`--sdk` 或 `--no-sdk`、`--json`","locale":"zh-CN"},"198":{"id":"/docs/cli-82","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`remove NAME`","locale":"zh-CN"},"199":{"id":"/docs/cli-83","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`--dry-run`、`--json`；删除命名引用，保留目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"200":{"id":"/docs/cli-84","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`uninstall SELECTOR`","locale":"zh-CN"},"201":{"id":"/docs/cli-85","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`--dry-run`、`--json`；删除整个托管目录及指向它的引用；不接受外部目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"202":{"id":"/docs/cli-86","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`doctor`","locale":"zh-CN"},"203":{"id":"/docs/cli-87","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`--dir PATH`、`--json`；只诊断，有错误时非零退出","locale":"zh-CN"},"204":{"id":"/docs/cli-88","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`cache clean`","locale":"zh-CN"},"205":{"id":"/docs/cli-89","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`--dry-run`、`--json`；清理闲置完整缓存负载","locale":"zh-CN"},"206":{"id":"/docs/cli-90","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`config show`","locale":"zh-CN"},"207":{"id":"/docs/cli-91","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"默认显示配置表格；`--resolved` 展示来源和派生关系；`--json` 输出 JSON","locale":"zh-CN"},"208":{"id":"/docs/cli-92","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`upgrade`","locale":"zh-CN"},"209":{"id":"/docs/cli-93","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`--check` 或 `--force`，互斥；仅 Windows x64 / ARM64 MSVC","locale":"zh-CN"},"210":{"id":"/docs/cli-94","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`self uninstall`","locale":"zh-CN"},"211":{"id":"/docs/cli-95","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`--dry-run`、`--purge`；默认保留管理器数据，无 json 选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"212":{"id":"/docs/cli-96","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#生命周期与清理","content":"`import` 不支持 dry-run；同名导入更新引用。版本查询和安装可能联网；本地管理不自动联网安装。不要假设每个命令都支持 `--json` 或 `--dry-run`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"213":{"id":"/docs/cli-97","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出约定","content":"信息查询默认使用对齐表格或字段列表。`list` 标记当前激活项和默认项，`alias` 与 `default` 展示引用目标的状态，目录路径单独成行。需要程序解析时使用命令提供的 `--json`；关闭日志不会隐藏查询结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"214":{"id":"/docs/cli-98","page_id":"/docs/cli","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cli#输出约定","content":"普通日志在 stderr，JSON 与生成脚本在 stdout。`exec` 子进程直接继承标准流。失败返回非零，不应加载失败生成的脚本。doctor 即使输出 JSON，发现问题仍失败；预览可以列出阻止项，实际执行才要求全部解决。Windows self uninstall 成功安排辅助脚本不等于程序已经删除，实际结果由脚本报告。","locale":"zh-CN"},"215":{"id":"/docs/cmd","page_id":"/docs/cmd","type":"page","content":"CMD 集成","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","Shell 集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/cmd","locale":"zh-CN"},"216":{"id":"/docs/cmd-0","page_id":"/docs/cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cmd","content":"实验性的批处理入口、DOSKEY 与当前用户 AutoRun。","locale":"zh-CN"},"217":{"id":"/docs/cmd-1","page_id":"/docs/cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cmd","content":"CMD 使用批处理和 DOSKEY 宏，不能使用 POSIX 的 eval。先生成并调用入口：","locale":"zh-CN"},"218":{"id":"/docs/cmd-2","page_id":"/docs/cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cmd","content":"交互终端中可以使用 `hanamori` 宏；在另一个 `.bat/.cmd` 文件里要通过 `call \"%_HANAMORI_CMD_ENTRY%\" use stable` 调用，不能依赖交互 DOSKEY 宏。","locale":"zh-CN"},"219":{"id":"/docs/cmd-3","page_id":"/docs/cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cmd","content":"原生 Windows 上可以管理当前用户的 AutoRun：","locale":"zh-CN"},"220":{"id":"/docs/cmd-4","page_id":"/docs/cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cmd","content":"原有 AutoRun 内容会保留，Hanamori 只修改自己拥有的调用和收据。`cmd /d` 跳过 AutoRun，此时请显式调用生成的入口。`--profile` 和 `--shell-executable` 不能用来选择 CMD 注册表位置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"221":{"id":"/docs/cmd-5","page_id":"/docs/cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cmd","content":"`hanamori.exe shell init --shell cmd --use-on-cd` 可在启动时选择项目或默认工具链，并安装交互式 `cd` DOSKEY 宏，在目录成功变化后重新选择。它会接管已有的 `cd` 宏；仅覆盖交互式 `cd`，不覆盖 `chdir`、`pushd/popd`、直接切换盘符和批处理里的目录切换。脚本请使用 `hanamori exec` / `hanamori run`。便携的 `env --shell cmd` 不支持此选项，必须使用持久初始化。","locale":"zh-CN"},"222":{"id":"/docs/cmd-6","page_id":"/docs/cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cmd","content":"撤销会保留辅助脚本供已打开的终端使用，不修改当前宏和已激活环境；先执行 `deactivate` 再关闭终端。自身卸载可以清理有记录且内容未改动的辅助脚本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"223":{"id":"/docs/cmd-7","page_id":"/docs/cmd","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/cmd","content":"CMD 仍为实验性支持。代码页、引号、交互 DOSKEY、批处理和 AutoRun 的 Windows 原生验收与交叉编译是不同事项。","locale":"zh-CN"},"224":{"id":"/docs/completions","page_id":"/docs/completions","type":"page","content":"终端补全","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","Shell 集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/completions","locale":"zh-CN"},"225":{"id":"/docs/completions-0","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions","content":"为 PowerShell、Bash 和 Zsh 启用命令、选项和路径补全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"226":{"id":"/docs/completions-1","page_id":"/docs/completions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/completions#随-shell-初始化启用","content":"随 Shell 初始化启用","locale":"zh-CN"},"227":{"id":"/docs/completions-2","page_id":"/docs/completions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/completions#仅在当前终端使用","content":"仅在当前终端使用","locale":"zh-CN"},"228":{"id":"/docs/completions-3","page_id":"/docs/completions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/completions#单独生成脚本","content":"单独生成脚本","locale":"zh-CN"},"229":{"id":"/docs/completions-4","page_id":"/docs/completions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"本地动态候选","locale":"zh-CN"},"230":{"id":"/docs/completions-5","page_id":"/docs/completions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"支持范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"231":{"id":"/docs/completions-6","page_id":"/docs/completions","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/completions#撤销与排查","content":"撤销与排查","locale":"zh-CN"},"232":{"id":"/docs/completions-7","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions","content":"Hanamori 从当前版本的命令定义生成补全脚本。按 Tab 可以补全公开命令、嵌套子命令和选项；生成脚本无需安装工具链、读取管理器配置或访问网络。按 Tab 查询本地候选时，只读取相关存储路径配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"233":{"id":"/docs/completions-8","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#随-shell-初始化启用","content":"省略 `--shell` 时自动检测调用 Shell，也可以明确指定 `powershell`、`bash` 或 `zsh`。与普通初始化一样，可使用 `--profile PATH` 或 `--shell-executable PATH`，并用 `--dry-run` 预览。","locale":"zh-CN"},"234":{"id":"/docs/completions-9","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#随-shell-初始化启用","content":"重新打开终端或按命令输出的提示加载 profile。启动配置只保存 loader，每次启动从当前程序生成补全，因此升级后新终端会使用新版命令定义。普通 `shell init` 默认不启用补全；再次执行时需保留 `--completions`，否则受管理区块将恢复为只加载钩子。","locale":"zh-CN"},"235":{"id":"/docs/completions-10","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#随-shell-初始化启用","content":"Zsh 的 Hanamori 启动区块应位于 `compinit`（或已初始化补全的框架）之后。缺少初始化时只提示并跳过补全，工具链钩子仍然可用；程序不会替用户运行 `compinit`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"236":{"id":"/docs/completions-11","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#仅在当前终端使用","content":"PowerShell：","locale":"zh-CN"},"237":{"id":"/docs/completions-12","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#仅在当前终端使用","content":"Bash：","locale":"zh-CN"},"238":{"id":"/docs/completions-13","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#仅在当前终端使用","content":"Zsh：","locale":"zh-CN"},"239":{"id":"/docs/completions-14","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#仅在当前终端使用","content":"这些命令同时加载 `use/deactivate` 钩子和补全。只需要补全时，将 `env --completions` 换成 `completions`；它不会加载环境钩子或激活工具链。","locale":"zh-CN"},"240":{"id":"/docs/completions-15","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#单独生成脚本","content":"`--shell/-s` 省略时自动检测，失败时要求显式指定。没有 `--output/-o` 时 stdout 只包含注册脚本；写入文件后需在相应 Shell 中加载它。生成的 Zsh 文件用于显式 `source`，不需要复制到系统补全目录。手工保存的脚本不会自动更新，升级后应重新生成并重新加载；重开终端可清除旧补全定义。","locale":"zh-CN"},"241":{"id":"/docs/completions-16","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#单独生成脚本","content":"同时注册 `hanamori` 和 `hanamori.exe`，支持加载钩子后的同名函数。可执行文件不在 PATH 时，仍可通过路径调用它生成脚本；在 Windows Bash/Zsh 中使用该 Shell 能识别的 POSIX 路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"242":{"id":"/docs/completions-17","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"三种 Shell 都支持以下本地候选；安装、导入或修改别名后，下次按 Tab 即读取新状态，无须重新生成脚本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"243":{"id":"/docs/completions-18","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"输入位置","locale":"zh-CN"},"244":{"id":"/docs/completions-19","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"候选","locale":"zh-CN"},"245":{"id":"/docs/completions-20","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"`use`、`default`、`alias` 的第一个位置参数","locale":"zh-CN"},"246":{"id":"/docs/completions-21","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"托管目录键、外部引用键、已有别名（包括 default）、无歧义的完整 MSVC 目录版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"247":{"id":"/docs/completions-22","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"`exec --using`、`shell activate` 的选择器","locale":"zh-CN"},"248":{"id":"/docs/completions-23","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"同上","locale":"zh-CN"},"249":{"id":"/docs/completions-24","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"`remove`、`unalias`","locale":"zh-CN"},"250":{"id":"/docs/completions-25","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"已有命名引用","locale":"zh-CN"},"251":{"id":"/docs/completions-26","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"`uninstall`","locale":"zh-CN"},"252":{"id":"/docs/completions-27","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"仅可用的托管目录键、托管引用及无歧义实际版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"253":{"id":"/docs/completions-28","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"`--dir PATH --toolset`","locale":"zh-CN"},"254":{"id":"/docs/completions-29","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"指定目录下的 MSVC 目录版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"255":{"id":"/docs/completions-30","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"`--dir PATH --sdk`","locale":"zh-CN"},"256":{"id":"/docs/completions-31","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"指定目录下的 SDK 目录版本；`--no-sdk` 时不提供候选","locale":"zh-CN"},"257":{"id":"/docs/completions-32","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"目录版本补全用于 `use`、`exec`、`import`、`env`、`shell activate` 和 `shell init`，也支持尚未登记的目录。它们是实际安装版本，例如 `14.44.35207` 和 `10.0.26100.0`，不是远端下载 ID。`alias` 的第二个参数是待创建的新名称，不补全已有选择器；安装命令和远端查询也不会混入本地版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"258":{"id":"/docs/completions-33","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"如果多个安装共用一个 MSVC 版本（例如 SDK 不同），该版本不能唯一选择安装，因此只提供精确目录键和引用。激活候选过滤不可用的目录；remove/unalias 仍可提示目标已经失效的引用。补全不修改文件，也不代替执行时检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"259":{"id":"/docs/completions-34","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"管理器选择统一遵循当前命令已输入的 `--manager-dir` → `HANAMORI_HOME` → 平台默认目录；Windows 默认为 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Hanamori`。函数、直接执行程序及补全使用同一规则，修改 HOME 后下次补全即生效。生成脚本时的 `--manager-dir` 不会保存为后备管理器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"260":{"id":"/docs/completions-35","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"支持 `--using=前缀`、带引号或转义的路径。补全只解释光标之前的字面参数，不执行其中的变量展开或命令表达式；需要这些表达式时，可先通过 `HANAMORI_HOME` 选择管理器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"261":{"id":"/docs/completions-36","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#本地动态候选","content":"候选查询按 CLI、环境变量、配置文件和默认值选择 `toolchains_dir`，不解析无关代理/日志设置或项目文件，不下载清单、不写文件、不取锁。单个引用损坏只跳过该引用；存储不可读时相关本地候选为空，静态命令和选项补全仍可用。手工保存的动态脚本调用生成时的程序路径；移动程序后应重新生成脚本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"262":{"id":"/docs/completions-37","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"263":{"id":"/docs/completions-38","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"264":{"id":"/docs/completions-39","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"命令与选项","locale":"zh-CN"},"265":{"id":"/docs/completions-40","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"PowerShell、Bash、Zsh 均支持，包括 `shell init`、`cache clean`、`self uninstall` 等嵌套命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"266":{"id":"/docs/completions-41","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"固定参数值","locale":"zh-CN"},"267":{"id":"/docs/completions-42","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"Bash/Zsh 提供 `--vs-version`、`--channel`、`--shell` 等命令定义中的候选","locale":"zh-CN"},"268":{"id":"/docs/completions-43","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"文件和目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"269":{"id":"/docs/completions-44","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"Bash/Zsh 使用路径提示与 Shell 的文件补全；包含空格的路径由 Shell 处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"270":{"id":"/docs/completions-45","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"PowerShell","locale":"zh-CN"},"271":{"id":"/docs/completions-46","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"支持上述本地动态候选；固定枚举值及普通路径仍受静态生成器限制，静态候选的上下文识别也可能受前置全局选项影响","locale":"zh-CN"},"272":{"id":"/docs/completions-47","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"目录键、别名、已安装版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"273":{"id":"/docs/completions-48","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"按输入位置扫描托管目录、引用或显式目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"274":{"id":"/docs/completions-49","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"远端工具集和 SDK ID","locale":"zh-CN"},"275":{"id":"/docs/completions-50","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"不联网查询，使用 `list-remote` 查看","locale":"zh-CN"},"276":{"id":"/docs/completions-51","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"`exec --` 后的内容","locale":"zh-CN"},"277":{"id":"/docs/completions-52","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"停止提供 Hanamori 参数；不负责外部程序自己的参数补全","locale":"zh-CN"},"278":{"id":"/docs/completions-53","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"CMD / Fish","locale":"zh-CN"},"279":{"id":"/docs/completions-54","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"当前不提供；CMD 请求补全会明确报错","locale":"zh-CN"},"280":{"id":"/docs/completions-55","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#支持范围","content":"候选是输入提示，不代替命令的参数校验。内部 `shell dispatch`、`shell cmd-dispatch`、`shell run` 不出现在候选中。","locale":"zh-CN"},"281":{"id":"/docs/completions-56","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#撤销与排查","content":"`hanamori shell deinit` 会移除受管理启动区块，`self uninstall` 也复用其归属记录清理。已加载的补全和函数留在当前会话，重开终端后消失。手工生成的补全文件及自行添加的 `source` 行需自行删除。","locale":"zh-CN"},"282":{"id":"/docs/completions-57","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#撤销与排查","content":"没有候选时，先确认已加载脚本、Shell 类型匹配，以及当前二进制包含 `completions` 命令。Zsh 出现 `compinit` 提示时，在初始化补全后重新加载脚本。本地候选为空时，核对管理目录并用 `list --json` / `doctor --json` 诊断目录和引用；补全自身不会显示这些诊断错误。升级后候选过时，请重新生成手工脚本或重开使用动态 loader 的终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"283":{"id":"/docs/completions-58","page_id":"/docs/completions","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/completions#撤销与排查","content":"更多说明：启动配置、Shell 集成、故障排查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"284":{"id":"/docs/configuration","page_id":"/docs/configuration","type":"page","content":"全局配置与存储","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","维护与参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/configuration","locale":"zh-CN"},"285":{"id":"/docs/configuration-0","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"配置优先级、路径解析、环境变量和目录职责。","locale":"zh-CN"},"286":{"id":"/docs/configuration-1","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"管理器位置按 `--manager-dir` → `HANAMORI_HOME` → 平台本地数据目录下的 `Hanamori` 选择。确定位置后读取 `<manager>/config.json`，管理器位置不从自己的配置中反向读取。","locale":"zh-CN"},"287":{"id":"/docs/configuration-2","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"Windows 默认目录为 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Hanamori`。Shell 钩子、启动 loader 和补全共用上述选择规则，不再单独保存管理目录绑定。需要自定义目录时，在加载钩子前设置 `HANAMORI_HOME`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"288":{"id":"/docs/configuration-3","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`schema_version` 可省略，目前为 1；未知字段忽略。其他配置按显式 CLI → 非空环境变量 → 配置文件 → 默认值解析。","locale":"zh-CN"},"289":{"id":"/docs/configuration-4","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"CLI / JSON 字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"290":{"id":"/docs/configuration-5","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"环境变量","locale":"zh-CN"},"291":{"id":"/docs/configuration-6","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"默认值","locale":"zh-CN"},"292":{"id":"/docs/configuration-7","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`--toolchains-dir` / `toolchains_dir`","locale":"zh-CN"},"293":{"id":"/docs/configuration-8","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`HANAMORI_TOOLCHAINS_DIR`","locale":"zh-CN"},"294":{"id":"/docs/configuration-9","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`<manager>/toolchains`","locale":"zh-CN"},"295":{"id":"/docs/configuration-10","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`--cache-dir` / `cache_dir`","locale":"zh-CN"},"296":{"id":"/docs/configuration-11","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`HANAMORI_CACHE_DIR`","locale":"zh-CN"},"297":{"id":"/docs/configuration-12","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`<manager>/cache`","locale":"zh-CN"},"298":{"id":"/docs/configuration-13","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`--download-dir` / `download_dir`","locale":"zh-CN"},"299":{"id":"/docs/configuration-14","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`HANAMORI_DOWNLOAD_DIR`","locale":"zh-CN"},"300":{"id":"/docs/configuration-15","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"临时下载工作区","locale":"zh-CN"},"301":{"id":"/docs/configuration-16","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`--proxy` / `proxy`","locale":"zh-CN"},"302":{"id":"/docs/configuration-17","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`HANAMORI_PROXY`","locale":"zh-CN"},"303":{"id":"/docs/configuration-18","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"304":{"id":"/docs/configuration-19","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`--mirror` / `mirror`","locale":"zh-CN"},"305":{"id":"/docs/configuration-20","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`HANAMORI_MIRROR`","locale":"zh-CN"},"306":{"id":"/docs/configuration-21","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"无","locale":"zh-CN"},"307":{"id":"/docs/configuration-22","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`--file-workers` / `file_workers`","locale":"zh-CN"},"308":{"id":"/docs/configuration-23","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`HANAMORI_FILE_WORKERS`","locale":"zh-CN"},"309":{"id":"/docs/configuration-24","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"4，范围 1–256","locale":"zh-CN"},"310":{"id":"/docs/configuration-25","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`--connections` / `connections`","locale":"zh-CN"},"311":{"id":"/docs/configuration-26","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`HANAMORI_CONNECTIONS`","locale":"zh-CN"},"312":{"id":"/docs/configuration-27","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"8，范围 1–64","locale":"zh-CN"},"313":{"id":"/docs/configuration-28","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`--log` / `log`","locale":"zh-CN"},"314":{"id":"/docs/configuration-29","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`HANAMORI_LOG`","locale":"zh-CN"},"315":{"id":"/docs/configuration-30","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`info` tracing 过滤器","locale":"zh-CN"},"316":{"id":"/docs/configuration-31","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"CLI 相对路径基于当前工作目录，配置文件中的路径基于管理器目录，环境路径必须为绝对路径。Hanamori 不展开 `~` 或变量表达式。`--proxy` 为 HTTP(S) 代理；mirror 只影响工具链负载 URL，不控制自我更新。","locale":"zh-CN"},"317":{"id":"/docs/configuration-32","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"`config show` 默认以表格展示配置项和有效值；`--resolved` 增加来源及路径派生关系。脚本读取配置时使用 `--json`，需要来源信息时同时指定 `--resolved`。查询、帮助、版本不创建存储。本地选择不解析无关的代理/下载选项；Shell 初始化和恢复有独立路径，不依赖完整配置可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"318":{"id":"/docs/configuration-33","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"设置只保存偏好；项目声明、命名引用和会话状态是不同职责。日志写 stderr；结构化结果和脚本写 stdout。诊断可能包含完整请求 URL，请按实际凭据和日志内容处理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"319":{"id":"/docs/configuration-34","page_id":"/docs/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/configuration","content":"所有本地命令和动态补全共用配置的 `toolchains_dir`。`references` 中的文件只为目标命名，删除引用不删除工具链，删除工具链也不会留下阻止重装的安装数据库记录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"320":{"id":"/docs/environment","page_id":"/docs/environment","type":"page","content":"环境与会话参考","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","维护与参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/environment","locale":"zh-CN"},"321":{"id":"/docs/environment-0","page_id":"/docs/environment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/environment","content":"了解哪些变量被管理，以及切换和恢复的边界。","locale":"zh-CN"},"322":{"id":"/docs/environment-1","page_id":"/docs/environment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/environment","content":"Hanamori 准备 PATH、INCLUDE、LIB、`CC`、`CXX`、`VCToolsVersion`、`VCToolsInstallDir`、`VCINSTALLDIR`、`VSCMD_ARG_HOST_ARCH`、`VSCMD_ARG_TGT_ARCH`、`DISTUTILS_USE_SDK`，以及安装了 SDK 时所需的 SDK 根目录、bin 和版本变量。","locale":"zh-CN"},"323":{"id":"/docs/environment-2","page_id":"/docs/environment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/environment","content":"SDK 工具路径为 `Windows Kits/10/bin/<版本>/<host>`，激活或 `exec` 后可按名称运行 `rc.exe`、`mt.exe`。`WindowsSdkVerBinPath` 仍指向不含架构的版本目录。安装完整性检查涵盖这两个工具及其随包 DLL；托管安装缺失这些文件时，重新运行对应的 `install` 可修复。","locale":"zh-CN"},"324":{"id":"/docs/environment-3","page_id":"/docs/environment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/environment","content":"程序不生成 `vcvarsall.bat` 或 `vcvars64.bat`。POSIX Shell 中可执行路径转换为 POSIX 形式，供编译器读取的 INCLUDE/LIB 保持 Windows 形式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"325":{"id":"/docs/environment-4","page_id":"/docs/environment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/environment","content":"`current` 反映当前会话保存的目录键、管理器、根目录和组件版本，不根据修改后的项目或别名重新计算。`--plain` 是即将选择的组合所生成的 `KEY=VALUE` 检查输出，不可直接当 Shell 脚本加载。","locale":"zh-CN"},"326":{"id":"/docs/environment-5","page_id":"/docs/environment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/environment","content":"首次激活保存原环境基线，切换保留这一基线；退出激活恢复原始值而非猜测 PATH 应该是什么。`exec` 使用同一环境准备逻辑，但只作用于子进程。内部 `_HANAMORI_*` 状态供钩子和子进程使用，不是用户配置接口，不应手工构造或编辑。","locale":"zh-CN"},"327":{"id":"/docs/environment-6","page_id":"/docs/environment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/environment","content":"遇到无效会话状态时，不要继续叠加激活；保留错误信息，使用干净的新终端检查安装和初始化配置。删除启动入口不自动撤销当前环境，卸载前应先退出激活。","locale":"zh-CN"},"328":{"id":"/docs/environment-7","page_id":"/docs/environment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/environment","content":"更新 Hanamori 后，如果提示会话变量与当前构建不匹配，请从桌面或开始菜单重新打开终端，再执行 `hanamori use`。当前终端中的子 Shell 会继承旧状态，不能用于清除它。这个错误不表示工具链安装损坏，无需重新安装 MSVC、SDK 或 MSBuild；程序不会猜测并补齐旧会话的原始环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"329":{"id":"/docs/environment-8","page_id":"/docs/environment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/environment","content":"选择包含 MSBuild 的组合时，还管理 `VSINSTALLDIR`、`VCTargetsPath`、`MSBuildExtensionsPath`、`MSBuildExtensionsPath32`、`ForceImportAfterCppDefaultProps`、`ForceImportAfterCppTargets`、`UseEnv`、`DisableRegistryUse` 和 `PreferredToolArchitecture`，并把私有 `MSBuild/Current/Bin/amd64` 加入 PATH。切换到普通组合会清除这些设置；停用时恢复激活前的值。`list/current --json` 的 `msbuild` 字段记录所选 MSBuild 版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"330":{"id":"/docs/environment-9","page_id":"/docs/environment","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/environment","content":"同时设置并管理 `MSBUILDDISABLENODEREUSE=1`，让构建节点在结束后退出，避免驻留的 MSBuild 进程继续占用工具链目录、阻止重装。并行构建仍可使用，但连续构建不能复用之前的节点。此设置用于后续启动的构建，不会结束已经驻留的进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"331":{"id":"/docs/execution","page_id":"/docs/execution","type":"page","content":"单次命令执行","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","工具链与执行"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/execution","locale":"zh-CN"},"332":{"id":"/docs/execution-0","page_id":"/docs/execution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/execution","content":"无需初始化 Shell，为构建子进程准备工具链环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"333":{"id":"/docs/execution-1","page_id":"/docs/execution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/execution","content":"`exec` 支持注册安装和显式未注册目录。`--using` 与 `--dir` 及其组件参数互斥。不指定选择方式时按最近项目文件、默认别名解析。目录有多个组合时，使用实际目录版本 `--toolset`、`--sdk` 或 `--no-sdk` 消除歧义。","locale":"zh-CN"},"334":{"id":"/docs/execution-2","page_id":"/docs/execution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/execution","content":"`--` 后必须有可执行程序，后续参数按原始 argv 传递，不解释管道、重定向、通配符、变量或 Shell 内建命令。需要这些语法时，显式运行 Shell，例如：","locale":"zh-CN"},"335":{"id":"/docs/execution-3","page_id":"/docs/execution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/execution","content":"子进程继承标准输入、输出和错误流，退出状态传回调用者。仅子进程获得准备好的环境，父终端不被激活。加载 PowerShell 钩子后，用 `'--'` 保证分隔符传递给 Hanamori；Windows PowerShell 使用已有的编码 argv 转发方式保留空字符串和引号。","locale":"zh-CN"},"336":{"id":"/docs/execution-4","page_id":"/docs/execution","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/execution","content":"当前公开命令是 `exec`，不提供 `run` 别名。用法与当前会话切换不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"337":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"Hanamori 文档","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs","locale":"zh-CN"},"338":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"独立安装、选择和管理 MSVC 与 Windows SDK。","locale":"zh-CN"},"339":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"Hanamori 在独立目录中安装 MSVC 与 Windows SDK，不需要安装 Visual Studio。你可以通过别名或项目文件选择工具链，切换当前终端环境，或为一个构建命令临时准备环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"340":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"从下载页获取程序，或从源码构建。","locale":"zh-CN"},"341":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"拥有的每套安装使用专属目录，导入的目录只是只读引用。选择工具链不会自动下载；安装工具链也不会自动激活终端。原生编译支持 Windows x64 / ARM64 主机和 x64 / ARM64 目标，其他平台上的测试不代表可以运行 MSVC。详见支持范围。","locale":"zh-CN"},"342":{"id":"/docs/installation","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"page","content":"安装与版本选择","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","工具链与执行"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation","locale":"zh-CN"},"343":{"id":"/docs/installation-0","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation","content":"理解下载标识、实际版本和独立安装目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"344":{"id":"/docs/installation-1","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"三种不同的标识","locale":"zh-CN"},"345":{"id":"/docs/installation-2","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#约束与选择","content":"约束与选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"346":{"id":"/docs/installation-3","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#目录与重新安装","content":"目录与重新安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"347":{"id":"/docs/installation-4","page_id":"/docs/installation","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/installation#msbuild-与组件选择","content":"MSBuild 与组件选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"348":{"id":"/docs/installation-5","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"标识","locale":"zh-CN"},"349":{"id":"/docs/installation-6","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"示例","locale":"zh-CN"},"350":{"id":"/docs/installation-7","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"用途","locale":"zh-CN"},"351":{"id":"/docs/installation-8","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"下载 ID","locale":"zh-CN"},"352":{"id":"/docs/installation-9","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"toolset `14.44.17.14`，SDK `26100`","locale":"zh-CN"},"353":{"id":"/docs/installation-10","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"在指定清单中选择安装包","locale":"zh-CN"},"354":{"id":"/docs/installation-11","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"实际版本","locale":"zh-CN"},"355":{"id":"/docs/installation-12","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"MSVC `14.44.35207`，SDK `10.0.26100.0`","locale":"zh-CN"},"356":{"id":"/docs/installation-13","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"解包后验证的目录版本，用于本地选择和项目约束","locale":"zh-CN"},"357":{"id":"/docs/installation-14","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"目录键","locale":"zh-CN"},"358":{"id":"/docs/installation-15","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"`vs2022-release/msvc-14.44.17.14_sdk-26100_host-x64_target-x64`","locale":"zh-CN"},"359":{"id":"/docs/installation-16","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"根据来源与下载 ID 确定的受管目录","locale":"zh-CN"},"360":{"id":"/docs/installation-17","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"示例只是语法示范，可用性以清单查询为准。远端 JSON 中未知的实际版本为 `null`，程序不会把包版本猜成编译器目录版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"361":{"id":"/docs/installation-18","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"`--vs-version` 支持 `2022`/`17`、`2026`/`18`；`--channel` 支持 `release`/`stable`、`preview`/`insiders`。默认 VS 2026 stable（`release`）。`--manifest URL` 替代二者，不能同时指定。`--arch HOST/TARGET` 支持 `x64/x64`、`x64/arm64`、`arm64/x64` 和 `arm64/arm64`。\n默认使用 Windows 原生架构，即使 Hanamori 本身运行在仿真环境中。显式 `--arch` 优先于项目的 `host`/`target`，项目配置优先于原生默认值。\nHost 决定编译器、SDK 工具和 MSBuild 的运行架构，Target 决定 CRT/SDK 库和 MSBuild 平台。\nARM64 Host 需要 Windows 11 ARM64；不支持 ARM32 或 ARM64EC。","locale":"zh-CN"},"362":{"id":"/docs/installation-19","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"不同架构组合使用独立目录，可以共存。外部目录包含多个组合时，在 `env`、`use`、`exec`、`import` 或 `doctor` 中使用 `--dir PATH --arch HOST/TARGET`。\n清单没有请求的组合时明确失败，不会替换成其他架构。","locale":"zh-CN"},"363":{"id":"/docs/installation-20","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"`list-remote --all` 按 VS 2022、VS 2026 分组列出所选渠道中的工具集和 SDK，并分别展开各组最新工具集的包。默认查询正式渠道；加 `--channel preview`（或 `insiders`）查询两者的预览渠道，不同时混入正式渠道。同名 ID 保留在各自来源组中。它与 `--vs-version`、`--manifest`、`--toolset-id` 互斥。这里的“全部”指当前支持的两代 VS 所选渠道中仍提供的版本，不保证覆盖微软历史上所有已撤下的版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"364":{"id":"/docs/installation-21","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#三种不同的标识","content":"`--all --json` 输出 `{ \"catalogs\": [...] }`；每组包含 `vs_version`、`channel`、`manifest_url`，以及单源查询已有的 `toolsets`、`sdks`、`selected_toolset_id` 和 `packages`。任意来源查询失败会使整个命令失败，不输出部分列表；默认警告/严格清单校验策略对两个来源均生效。","locale":"zh-CN"},"365":{"id":"/docs/installation-22","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#约束与选择","content":"`install [VERSION]` 接受托管目录键、实际 MSVC 版本、数字前缀或 `latest`。`--sdk VERSION` 是实际四段 SDK 版本，`--no-sdk` 排除 SDK，默认也不安装 MSBuild。`--toolset-id` 和 `--sdk-id` 是下载 ID，分别与对应的实际版本命令行参数互斥。","locale":"zh-CN"},"366":{"id":"/docs/installation-23","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#约束与选择","content":"安装会读取最近的项目文件。显式实际版本参数替换相应的项目约束；未指定的约束继续保留。下载 ID 只指定负载，解包后的实际版本仍必须符合项目约束。无法从已知安装映射实际版本到下载 ID 时，程序报错并要求查询清单、显式指定 ID，不会退回 latest。","locale":"zh-CN"},"367":{"id":"/docs/installation-24","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#约束与选择","content":"没有显式版本或项目文件时，从所选渠道安装最新组合；默认引用不是安装输入。","locale":"zh-CN"},"368":{"id":"/docs/installation-25","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#目录与重新安装","content":"不含 MSBuild 的受管目录为 `<toolchains-dir>/<source>/msvc-<下载ID>_sdk-<下载ID或none>_host-x64_target-x64`；默认含 MSBuild 的目录还带有 `_msbuild-<版本>` 段，默认存储根目录是 `<manager>/toolchains`。自定义来源用清单 URL 的稳定摘要区分，清单内容改变不会改变目录身份。本地命令和补全也遵循配置的工具链存储目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"369":{"id":"/docs/installation-26","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#目录与重新安装","content":"目录通过少量必需文件检查后直接复用；目录不存在、为空或缺少关键文件时，自动安装到原位置，已有引用仍有效。`--reinstall` 强制重建，用于普通头文件等快速检查未覆盖的损坏。`--name` 在安装成功后创建或更新引用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"370":{"id":"/docs/installation-27","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#目录与重新安装","content":"`--dir` 是便携安装：接受不存在或空目录；非空外部目录须明确指定 `--reinstall`，这会替换整个目录，请勿存放个人文件。通过显式 `--dir` 或外部引用使用便携安装；uninstall 不删除外部引用目标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"371":{"id":"/docs/installation-28","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#目录与重新安装","content":"`--dry-run` 可能读取清单，但不下载工具链负载、不创建目录。清单哈希或大小不一致默认告警，`--strict-manifest-integrity` 改为错误。负载完整性校验始终启用。不同组合各自保存 SDK，共享下载缓存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"372":{"id":"/docs/installation-29","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#目录与重新安装","content":"用精确目录键安装会固定来源和下载 ID；自定义来源的目录键还需传入原来的 `--manifest URL`。按版本安装可继承项目约束；显式目录键直接选择该键中的组合。","locale":"zh-CN"},"373":{"id":"/docs/installation-30","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#msbuild-与组件选择","content":"默认安装 MSVC、Windows SDK 和 MSBuild，从同一清单选择 MSBuild 18.x（VS 2026）或 17.x（VS 2022）、C++ props/targets、任务程序集和 FileTracker。`--no-msbuild` 排除 MSBuild，保留编译器与 SDK。`--no-sdk` 或项目 `\"sdk\": null` 默认只安装编译器。","locale":"zh-CN"},"374":{"id":"/docs/installation-31","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#msbuild-与组件选择","content":"组件选择遵循显式命令行参数 → 项目设置 → 默认值。项目可声明 `\"msbuild\": true` 或 `false`，`--msbuild` / `--no-msbuild` 可覆盖它。明确要求 MSBuild 时必须同时安装 SDK，否则报错；可以用 `--no-msbuild` 撤销该要求。固定目录键始终保留键中的组件组合，不因默认值改变而增加 MSBuild。","locale":"zh-CN"},"375":{"id":"/docs/installation-32","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#msbuild-与组件选择","content":"支持范围是 VS 2026 v145 和 VS 2022 v143 原生 C++ `.vcxproj` 和 `.sln`。v143 项目请指定 `--vs-version 2022`。不承诺 Win32、ATL/MFC、C++/CLI、UWP、驱动、C# 或 Visual Studio IDE 集成。此功能的 Windows 原生构建验收尚待执行；真实包下载/解包与 Linux 回归不能替代它。","locale":"zh-CN"},"376":{"id":"/docs/installation-33","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#msbuild-与组件选择","content":"包含 MSBuild 的目录键为 `<source>/msvc-<ID>_sdk-<ID>_msbuild-<MSBuild版本>_host-x64_target-x64`，与不含 MSBuild 的组合独立共存。重新安装精确键会校验清单仍提供对应 MSBuild 版本；不会静默替换成新版。上游撤包时需提供匹配的清单及缓存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"377":{"id":"/docs/installation-34","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#msbuild-与组件选择","content":"主机需具备 MSBuild 所需的 .NET Framework。安装只解包和检查文件；Windows 上的 `doctor` 额外启动 `MSBuild.exe -version` 诊断运行时，失败会报错，不自动安装系统组件。通过 Hanamori 环境调用 `MSBuild.exe`，生成的配置会指向所选工具链的编译器和 SDK；项目显式要求不同版本时构建失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"378":{"id":"/docs/installation-35","page_id":"/docs/installation","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/installation#msbuild-与组件选择","content":"FileTracker 使用私有目录，不借用系统安装。其上游实现有 ANSI 路径限制，首版建议将 MSBuild 工具链安装在 ASCII 路径下，例如 `--dir D:/Tools/hanamori-build`；这与项目目录含 Unicode 是两个不同的情况。","locale":"zh-CN"},"379":{"id":"/docs/maintenance","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","type":"page","content":"导入、重装与清理","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","维护与参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/maintenance","locale":"zh-CN"},"380":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-0","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance","content":"通过目录发现、引用和重新安装管理工具链。","locale":"zh-CN"},"381":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-1","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/maintenance#引用外部工具链","content":"引用外部工具链","locale":"zh-CN"},"382":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-2","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"删除与清理","locale":"zh-CN"},"383":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-3","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/maintenance#重装与中断处理","content":"重装与中断处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"384":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-4","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#引用外部工具链","content":"`import` 的 `--name` 必填。命令检查选定组合，只在管理目录的 `references/` 保存路径和实际版本，不修改外部目录。同名引用会更新；移动外部工具链后，以原来的名字重新 import 新路径即可。同一目录的不同组合可以使用不同名字。","locale":"zh-CN"},"385":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-5","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"命令","locale":"zh-CN"},"386":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-6","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"行为","locale":"zh-CN"},"387":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-7","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"`remove NAME` / `unalias NAME`","locale":"zh-CN"},"388":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-8","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"删除一个引用；工具链文件保留，其他引用保留","locale":"zh-CN"},"389":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-9","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"`uninstall SELECTOR`","locale":"zh-CN"},"390":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-10","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"删除受管目录和指向该目录的引用；拒绝删除外部引用目标","locale":"zh-CN"},"391":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-11","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"`cache clean`","locale":"zh-CN"},"392":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-12","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"清理完整下载缓存，不改变安装","locale":"zh-CN"},"393":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-13","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"`self uninstall`","locale":"zh-CN"},"394":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-14","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"删除程序及其启动入口，默认保留工具链","locale":"zh-CN"},"395":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-15","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"`self uninstall --purge`","locale":"zh-CN"},"396":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-16","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"额外清理受管工具链、完整缓存、配置和引用，保留外部工具链","locale":"zh-CN"},"397":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-17","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#删除与清理","content":"`uninstall` 接受目录键、引用或唯一版本前缀；目标已经缺少文件仍可卸载。目录整体已删除时，使用精确目录键或失效的受管引用也能完成清理。当前会话正在使用目标时先 deactivate；Windows 上取得目录锁后，会通过 Windows Restart Manager 关闭使用目标文件的进程，再删除目录。`self uninstall --purge` 清理工具链时使用相同流程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"398":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-18","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#重装与中断处理","content":"受管目录不存在、为空或缺少关键文件时，原安装命令会重新安装。普通头文件等未纳入快速检查的损坏，用 `--reinstall` 强制重建。检查不计算逐文件哈希。","locale":"zh-CN"},"399":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-19","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#重装与中断处理","content":"下载、解包和必需文件检查完成后才替换旧受管目录。新内容在同卷暂存，发布时先把旧目录改名，再将新目录就位；失败时恢复旧目录。进程中断留下的 `.stage` / `.old` 目录由下一次对同一目标的安装处理。`doctor` 只报告问题，不修改文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"400":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-20","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#重装与中断处理","content":"Windows 上实际替换目录前，Hanamori 会将旧安装中的文件交给 Windows Restart Manager，查询使用这些文件的进程，打印名称和 PID，并请求关闭；未响应的进程会被强制关闭。操作按目标安装文件限定范围，不按 `MSBuild.exe`、`mspdbsrv.exe` 或 `vctip.exe` 等名称全局结束进程。微软包中的 PDB 服务和遥测程序均完整保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"401":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-21","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#重装与中断处理","content":"替换当前安装所需的关闭操作只发生在新内容解包、校验成功后；复用或准备失败不会关闭当前安装的使用者。清理上次中断留下的 `.stage` / `.old` 目录时，也会关闭使用这些残留文件的进程。`--dry-run` 不关闭进程。重装或卸载前保存工作并等待相关构建结束，因为使用该工具链的进程会被结束。无法关闭的进程、目录句柄或权限问题仍会阻止操作；根据日志手动处理后重试。退出 Shell 激活不会结束已驻留的进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"402":{"id":"/docs/maintenance-22","page_id":"/docs/maintenance","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/maintenance#重装与中断处理","content":"包含 MSBuild 的组合还检查引擎、C++ targets、任务程序集、FileTracker 和生成配置；Windows 上的 `doctor` 会执行引擎版本探测，区分缺失文件与运行时启动失败。其他平台只检查文件。删除这些关键文件后，用 `list` 中的完整目录键重新安装即可修复。`import` 会保留 Hanamori 便携安装的 MSBuild 版本；不会把任意 Visual Studio 目录转换成受支持的独立 MSBuild 安装。","locale":"zh-CN"},"403":{"id":"/docs/powershell","page_id":"/docs/powershell","type":"page","content":"PowerShell","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","Shell 集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/powershell","locale":"zh-CN"},"404":{"id":"/docs/powershell-0","page_id":"/docs/powershell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/powershell","content":"区分 PowerShell 5.1/7 的启动文件，正确传递脚本和参数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"405":{"id":"/docs/powershell-1","page_id":"/docs/powershell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/powershell","content":"推荐先在当前终端加载：","locale":"zh-CN"},"406":{"id":"/docs/powershell-2","page_id":"/docs/powershell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/powershell","content":"点号加载让脚本修改当前 Shell。不要在生成失败后继续加载旧文件。执行策略可能限制脚本加载，请按自己的系统策略处理；Hanamori 不替你永久放宽执行策略。","locale":"zh-CN"},"407":{"id":"/docs/powershell-3","page_id":"/docs/powershell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/powershell","content":"持久配置时选择真正使用的运行时：","locale":"zh-CN"},"408":{"id":"/docs/powershell-4","page_id":"/docs/powershell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/powershell","content":"发现过程禁用 profile 执行，查询所选运行时的用户 profile。默认路径不可用时不会偷偷改写另一版本的文件；可以使用 `--profile PATH` 明确指定。已有 UTF-16 profile 的编码会保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"409":{"id":"/docs/powershell-5","page_id":"/docs/powershell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/powershell","content":"包装函数中，`exec` 的分隔符写成 `'--'`。用 `$LASTEXITCODE` 检查原生子进程状态。执行 `shell deinit` 后，当前函数仍已加载，需要关闭并重开终端。","locale":"zh-CN"},"410":{"id":"/docs/profiles","page_id":"/docs/profiles","type":"page","content":"启动配置","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","Shell 集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/profiles","locale":"zh-CN"},"411":{"id":"/docs/profiles-0","page_id":"/docs/profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/profiles","content":"在新终端中动态加载 Hanamori 钩子，并撤销配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"412":{"id":"/docs/profiles-1","page_id":"/docs/profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/profiles","content":"`--use-on-cd` 开启启动及目录变化时的项目工具链选择，默认关闭。更新初始化时需保留此参数，否则后续启动恢复为不自动切换。PowerShell 中请将初始化区块放在提示符主题设置之后。行为和 Shell 差异见 Shell 集成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"413":{"id":"/docs/profiles-2","page_id":"/docs/profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/profiles","content":"`--completions` 将补全一并加入动态 loader，每次启动重新生成，默认关闭。再次初始化时保留此参数，否则会恢复为仅加载钩子。Zsh 的受管理区块应位于 `compinit` 或框架的补全初始化之后。`shell deinit` 和自身卸载会按原有归属记录清理整个区块，当前会话的补全需重开终端才移除。详见终端补全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"414":{"id":"/docs/profiles-3","page_id":"/docs/profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/profiles","content":"`--profile PATH` 明确指定文件；`--shell-executable` 选择用于发现启动文件的运行时，二者互斥。自动检测会使用实际发现的 Shell 程序，区分 PowerShell 5.1 与 7。未指定 `--shell` 时，可识别的运行时文件名也能确定类型；重命名的程序应同时指定类型与运行时路径。","locale":"zh-CN"},"415":{"id":"/docs/profiles-4","page_id":"/docs/profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/profiles","content":"写入的是动态调用 `env` 的 loader，不是某一套工具链的固定环境。管理区块以外的字节、编码与换行保留；重复初始化与撤销保持稳定，修改前保留原文件备份。Bash 会维护交互入口及适当的登录桥接；Zsh 尊重 `ZDOTDIR`。显式指定某个 Bash profile 只处理该文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"416":{"id":"/docs/profiles-5","page_id":"/docs/profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/profiles","content":"初始化记录实际程序、profile 路径及区块内容，供自身卸载核对归属。记录放在用户数据目录的 `Hanamori/shell/registrations`，独立于选择的管理器；Unix 非 Unicode 路径也可以保存。","locale":"zh-CN"},"417":{"id":"/docs/profiles-6","page_id":"/docs/profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/profiles","content":"撤销只影响后续加载，不会退出当前工具链，也不会立即移除内存中的函数。当前终端先 `hanamori deactivate`，然后重开终端。`--dry-run` 不写 profile、备份、锁、记录或注册表。CMD 使用不同机制，见CMD 集成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"418":{"id":"/docs/profiles-7","page_id":"/docs/profiles","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/profiles","content":"启动 loader 不保存管理目录；自定义位置通过 profile 中的 `HANAMORI_HOME` 设置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"419":{"id":"/docs/projects","page_id":"/docs/projects","type":"page","content":"项目选择","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","工具链与执行"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/projects","locale":"zh-CN"},"420":{"id":"/docs/projects-0","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"使用项目文件固定编译要求，理解最近文件和本地解析顺序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"421":{"id":"/docs/projects-1","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"在项目根目录创建 `hanamori-toolchain.json`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"422":{"id":"/docs/projects-2","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"字段","locale":"zh-CN"},"423":{"id":"/docs/projects-3","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"424":{"id":"/docs/projects-4","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"`toolset`","locale":"zh-CN"},"425":{"id":"/docs/projects-5","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"必填；实际 MSVC 版本或一至三段数字前缀","locale":"zh-CN"},"426":{"id":"/docs/projects-6","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"`sdk`","locale":"zh-CN"},"427":{"id":"/docs/projects-7","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"实际四段版本；`null` 表示不使用 SDK；省略表示不约束","locale":"zh-CN"},"428":{"id":"/docs/projects-8","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"`msbuild`","locale":"zh-CN"},"429":{"id":"/docs/projects-9","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"可选布尔值；`true` 要求 MSBuild，`false` 排除，省略不限制本地选择；安装时默认随 SDK 启用，SDK 为 `null` 时默认关闭","locale":"zh-CN"},"430":{"id":"/docs/projects-10","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"`host`、`target`","locale":"zh-CN"},"431":{"id":"/docs/projects-11","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"可选 `x64` 或 `arm64`；host 默认为 Windows 原生架构，target 默认跟随 host","locale":"zh-CN"},"432":{"id":"/docs/projects-12","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"`vs`、`channel`","locale":"zh-CN"},"433":{"id":"/docs/projects-13","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"可选来源约束；来源未知的导入记录不能满足","locale":"zh-CN"},"434":{"id":"/docs/projects-14","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"`schema_version`","locale":"zh-CN"},"435":{"id":"/docs/projects-15","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"可选，目前为 `1`","locale":"zh-CN"},"436":{"id":"/docs/projects-16","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"未知字段会被忽略。当前目录及祖先中最近的文件生效；最近文件损坏时停止，不跳过它去使用上级文件或默认值。","locale":"zh-CN"},"437":{"id":"/docs/projects-17","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"选择顺序为：显式选择器/目录 → 最近项目文件 → `default`。多个候选匹配会报歧义，要求使用 ID 或别名；不会替你在 SDK 或来源之间选择。选择只查询本地，不自动下载，也不接受浮动 `latest`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"438":{"id":"/docs/projects-18","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"`install` 同样读取项目文件。显式实际版本/SDK 参数覆盖对应字段，下载 ID 则指定要获取的负载，同时保留项目的实际版本约束：","locale":"zh-CN"},"439":{"id":"/docs/projects-19","page_id":"/docs/projects","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/projects","content":"项目声明不是上游永远提供负载的保证。需要长期复现时保留原安装命令、下载 ID 和相关缓存。项目文件不负责保存本机目录键、别名或当前会话。显式指定托管目录键安装时直接使用该组合，不读取项目文件。","locale":"zh-CN"},"440":{"id":"/docs/quick-start","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"page","content":"首次编译","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start","locale":"zh-CN"},"441":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-0","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"从安装工具链到编译、运行一个完整 C++ 程序。","locale":"zh-CN"},"442":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-1","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#1-安装工具链","content":"1\\. 安装工具链","locale":"zh-CN"},"443":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-2","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#2-保存源文件","content":"2\\. 保存源文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"444":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-3","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#3-编译并运行","content":"3\\. 编译并运行","locale":"zh-CN"},"445":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-4","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#4-在当前终端切换","content":"4\\. 在当前终端切换","locale":"zh-CN"},"446":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-5","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/quick-start#5-清理练习","content":"5\\. 清理练习","locale":"zh-CN"},"447":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-6","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start","content":"先获取 Hanamori，将 `hanamori.exe` 所在目录加入 PATH。在一个可写的项目目录中打开 PowerShell。以下命令使用微软默认的 VS 2026 stable 清单；安装需要网络和磁盘空间。","locale":"zh-CN"},"448":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-7","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#1-安装工具链","content":"`stable` 是你创建的本地别名。安装不会自动激活当前终端，`default` 也只是记录默认选择。最新可用版本取决于所选清单。","locale":"zh-CN"},"449":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-8","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#2-保存源文件","content":"创建 `hello.cpp`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"450":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-9","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#2-保存源文件","content":"这个例子同时使用 C++ 标准库和 Windows SDK，因此不要给安装加 `--no-sdk`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"451":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-10","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#3-编译并运行","content":"`exec` 不需要 Shell 初始化，编译环境只传递给子进程。PowerShell 中使用 `'--'`，也能兼容已经加载的 Hanamori 包装函数。预期输出包含 `Hello from Hanamori!`，进程 ID 每次可能不同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"452":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-11","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#4-在当前终端切换","content":"`use` 按项目文件或默认值选择；若当前目录存在 `hanamori-toolchain.json`，它优先于默认值。明确指定 `hanamori use stable` 可覆盖项目选择。`deactivate` 恢复激活前的环境。希望新终端自动加载钩子，请看启动配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"453":{"id":"/docs/quick-start-12","page_id":"/docs/quick-start","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/quick-start#5-清理练习","content":"这会删除整个托管安装目录及其别名，不会删除当前目录的 `hello.cpp`。不要把个人文件放入工具链目录。仅想删除 stable 名字时，使用 `remove stable`，目录仍会被 list 发现。详见导入、重装与清理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"454":{"id":"/docs/release","page_id":"/docs/release","type":"page","content":"发布流程","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/release","locale":"zh-CN"},"455":{"id":"/docs/release-0","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release","content":"选择既有标签，共用检查后发布 Windows 程序和 crates.io 包。","locale":"zh-CN"},"456":{"id":"/docs/release-1","page_id":"/docs/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/release#更新版本与创建标签","content":"更新版本与创建标签","locale":"zh-CN"},"457":{"id":"/docs/release-2","page_id":"/docs/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/release#选择标签与渠道","content":"选择标签与渠道","locale":"zh-CN"},"458":{"id":"/docs/release-3","page_id":"/docs/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/release#检查构建与发布","content":"检查、构建与发布","locale":"zh-CN"},"459":{"id":"/docs/release-4","page_id":"/docs/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/release#cratesio-凭据与重试","content":"crates.io 凭据与重试","locale":"zh-CN"},"460":{"id":"/docs/release-5","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release","content":"Release 工作流 统一发布 GitHub Release 和 `hanamori` crate。推送 `v*` 标签时发布到两个渠道；手动运行时可以选择标签和发布渠道。普通 main 推送与网站构建不发布版本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"461":{"id":"/docs/release-6","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#更新版本与创建标签","content":"在工作区或其成员包目录中使用仓库自带的 `xtask`：","locale":"zh-CN"},"462":{"id":"/docs/release-7","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#更新版本与创建标签","content":"选择其中一种递增方式。命令更新 `Cargo.toml` 的 `workspace.package.version`，并由 Cargo 同步 `Cargo.lock` 中的工作区包版本，保留已锁定的依赖版本。命令不会提交修改或创建标签。先提交版本修改，再创建标签：","locale":"zh-CN"},"463":{"id":"/docs/release-8","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#更新版本与创建标签","content":"`cargo xtask tag` 在 `HEAD` 创建带注释的 `v版本号` 标签，默认不推送。默认版本来自当前工作区，而非已有 Git 标签中的最高版本。也可显式指定版本，例如 `cargo xtask tag 0.1.2 --push`；指定值必须与工作区版本一致。已跟踪文件的修改必须先提交，已有标签不会被覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"464":{"id":"/docs/release-9","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#更新版本与创建标签","content":"`--push` 仅将刚创建的标签推送到 `origin`，触发两个发布渠道。推送失败时保留本地标签，并输出可重试的 `git push` 命令。","locale":"zh-CN"},"465":{"id":"/docs/release-10","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#选择标签与渠道","content":"在 Actions 中选择 **Release → Run workflow**，使用 `main` 上的工作流：","locale":"zh-CN"},"466":{"id":"/docs/release-11","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#选择标签与渠道","content":"输入","locale":"zh-CN"},"467":{"id":"/docs/release-12","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#选择标签与渠道","content":"含义","locale":"zh-CN"},"468":{"id":"/docs/release-13","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#选择标签与渠道","content":"`tag`","locale":"zh-CN"},"469":{"id":"/docs/release-14","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#选择标签与渠道","content":"可选的既有 `v*` Git 标签，例如 `v0.1.0`。留空时按 Git 版本排序选择最高的 `v*` 标签，而非按标签创建时间或 GitHub Release 时间选择。","locale":"zh-CN"},"470":{"id":"/docs/release-15","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#选择标签与渠道","content":"`target`","locale":"zh-CN"},"471":{"id":"/docs/release-16","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#选择标签与渠道","content":"`all`（默认）同时发布两个渠道；`github` 只发布 GitHub Release；`crates-io` 只发布 crate。","locale":"zh-CN"},"472":{"id":"/docs/release-17","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#选择标签与渠道","content":"工作流不会创建标签。没有 `v*` 标签、指定标签不存在，或标签版本与对应源码的 Cargo 版本不一致时，发布停止。推送标签触发时使用该标签；手动运行的 `tag` 输入优先。","locale":"zh-CN"},"473":{"id":"/docs/release-18","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#检查构建与发布","content":"更新工作区版本和由 Cargo 生成的锁文件，创建指向目标源码的 `v*` 标签。","locale":"zh-CN"},"474":{"id":"/docs/release-19","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#检查构建与发布","content":"Release 获取全部标签，解析所选标签的提交，并校验该提交的 Cargo 包名称、版本和二进制目标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"475":{"id":"/docs/release-20","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#检查构建与发布","content":"复用 CI 工作流和 Installers 工作流，分别验证同一提交的 Rust 代码和安装脚本。Rust 检查包括格式、模块架构和测试；安装检查包括 Linux 参数与元数据，以及原生 Windows 安装。Windows 使用 release 配置及 `x86_64-pc-windows-msvc` / `aarch64-pc-windows-msvc` 目标。","locale":"zh-CN"},"476":{"id":"/docs/release-21","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#检查构建与发布","content":"检查通过后，所选渠道分别从同一提交构建和发布。普通分支 CI 不响应标签推送；一次 Release 的两个渠道共用检查，不再分别运行 `cargo test`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"477":{"id":"/docs/release-22","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#检查构建与发布","content":"GitHub 渠道分别在 Windows x64 和 `windows-11-arm` 构建 `hanamori-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.exe`、`hanamori-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.exe` 及各自同名 ZIP。ZIP 内为 `hanamori.exe`；四个资产都验证 GitHub 报告的 SHA-256 digest。","locale":"zh-CN"},"478":{"id":"/docs/release-23","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#检查构建与发布","content":"crates.io 渠道运行 `cargo publish --locked`，保留包内源码的编译验证，仅发布 `hanamori`，不发布 `hanamori-test-support` 或 `xtask`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"479":{"id":"/docs/release-24","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#检查构建与发布","content":"两种发布渠道在共享检查通过后独立执行。某个渠道失败时，可手动选择尚未发布的渠道和同一标签重试。手动发布旧标签时，检查和构建使用该标签源码，而不是工作流所在的 main 源码。","locale":"zh-CN"},"480":{"id":"/docs/release-25","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#检查构建与发布","content":"成功的 CI、网站上线或某个渠道发布成功，都不代表另一渠道已经发布。GitHub Release 完成后，还应确认用户能够下载对应资产。下载页和自我更新按上述资产名称匹配版本；下载页查询公开 API，不包含 Token。","locale":"zh-CN"},"481":{"id":"/docs/release-26","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#cratesio-凭据与重试","content":"在仓库的 Actions Secrets 中配置 `CARGO_REGISTRY_TOKEN`，使用有权发布 `hanamori` 的 crates.io API token。首次发布需要创建 crate 的权限；后续发布需要该 crate 的发布权限。","locale":"zh-CN"},"482":{"id":"/docs/release-27","page_id":"/docs/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/release#cratesio-凭据与重试","content":"发布前可在本地执行 `cargo publish --locked --registry crates-io -p hanamori --dry-run`，验证包内源码能够编译而不上传。crates.io 已发布的版本不能覆盖；如果 crate 已发布、只需补发 GitHub 资产，请选择 `target=github`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"483":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","type":"page","content":"卸载 Hanamori","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","维护与参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/self-uninstall","locale":"zh-CN"},"484":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-0","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/self-uninstall","content":"删除当前程序，或额外清理所选管理器拥有的数据。","locale":"zh-CN"},"485":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-1","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/self-uninstall#启动入口与会话","content":"启动入口与会话","locale":"zh-CN"},"486":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-2","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/self-uninstall#失败后如何处理","content":"失败后如何处理","locale":"zh-CN"},"487":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-3","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/self-uninstall","content":"默认删除当前正在运行的程序、同级 `.outdated` 升级备份和已记录且仍可确认归属的启动入口。MSVC、SDK、配置和命名引用保留，以便之后重新放入程序继续管理。程序位于 Downloads 时，不会递归删除 Downloads。","locale":"zh-CN"},"488":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-4","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/self-uninstall","content":"`--purge` 额外删除当前 `toolchains_dir` 下发现的托管工具链，包括不完整的目录；清理配置指定缓存的完整负载，最后删除命名引用与 `config.json`。外部导入或 `install --dir` 创建的目录只移除引用，实体文件不删除。若多个管理器配置为同一个工具链存储目录，它们共享这些实体目录；清理也会影响它们。共享缓存可能失去完整负载，与 `cache clean` 相同。","locale":"zh-CN"},"489":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-5","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/self-uninstall","content":"未知文件、下载工作区、profile 备份和锁文件（包括 `.update.lock`）保留；剩余目录不递归清空。托管目录整体删除，不要把需要保留的文件放入其中。若程序或管理器位于待删除的工具链中，先移到外部。","locale":"zh-CN"},"490":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-6","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/self-uninstall#启动入口与会话","content":"Windows 安装脚本在程序旁保存 `hanamori.exe.install.json`，只记录它添加的用户 PATH 条目。卸载会移除该条目和记录，保留原有 PATH 内容与环境变量引用。安装前已存在的 PATH 条目不归安装脚本所有；移动程序后，旧安装位置的 PATH 需要手动清理。","locale":"zh-CN"},"491":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-7","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/self-uninstall#启动入口与会话","content":"先 `hanamori deactivate`，并关闭其他使用 Hanamori 的终端。新的 `shell init` 将实际入口写入用户数据目录的 `Hanamori/shell/registrations`；Windows 使用 LOCALAPPDATA，Unix 使用 XDG_DATA_HOME 或 `~/.local/share`。Bash 登录桥接和 CMD 辅助脚本也记录在内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"492":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-8","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/self-uninstall#启动入口与会话","content":"卸载核对区块内容、profile 位置或 CMD loader 归属；修改过的入口会保留并提示。没有归属记录的入口需要手动清理，或先以相同 profile/运行时选项重新初始化。手动加入的 PATH、Windows 卸载注册表项不会被修改。重开终端才会丢弃已加载的函数。","locale":"zh-CN"},"493":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-9","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/self-uninstall#失败后如何处理","content":"`--purge` 复用工具链卸载和缓存清理的文件占用处理。工具链或缓存清理失败时，停止删除程序和剩余管理器元数据；先前已完成的卸载不回滚。按错误提示处理后重试；不完整的托管目录仍可再次卸载。预览不写文件、改注册表、取锁、关闭进程或启动辅助进程。","locale":"zh-CN"},"494":{"id":"/docs/self-uninstall-10","page_id":"/docs/self-uninstall","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/self-uninstall#失败后如何处理","content":"Windows 最后启动临时 PowerShell 脚本，等待主进程退出后删除精确程序路径和备份，不终止其他进程。CLI 报告“已安排”，辅助脚本另行报告结果。删除失败时，在显示的临时目录保留 `failure.txt`、`files.json`、`uninstall.ps1`；关闭占用进程后，不带参数重新运行脚本。成功后删除辅助文件和空临时目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"495":{"id":"/docs/shell","page_id":"/docs/shell","type":"page","content":"Shell 集成","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","Shell 集成"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/shell","locale":"zh-CN"},"496":{"id":"/docs/shell-0","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell","content":"初始化钩子，在当前终端切换并恢复工具链环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"497":{"id":"/docs/shell-1","page_id":"/docs/shell","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/shell#自动检测与目录选择","content":"自动检测与目录选择","locale":"zh-CN"},"498":{"id":"/docs/shell-2","page_id":"/docs/shell","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/shell#会话语义","content":"会话语义","locale":"zh-CN"},"499":{"id":"/docs/shell-3","page_id":"/docs/shell","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/shell#随项目自动切换","content":"随项目自动切换","locale":"zh-CN"},"500":{"id":"/docs/shell-4","page_id":"/docs/shell","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/shell#一次性脚本","content":"一次性脚本","locale":"zh-CN"},"501":{"id":"/docs/shell-5","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell","content":"安装完成后，每个终端需要单独初始化。默认只加载钩子，不选择安装、不读取项目，也不访问网络；`--auto-activate` 仅在非活动会话加载钩子时尝试一次，失败不妨碍继续使用终端。需要随目录切换工具链时，显式启用 `--use-on-cd`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"502":{"id":"/docs/shell-6","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell","content":"Bash/Zsh 中使用 `hanamori env --output hanamori-init.sh && . ./hanamori-init.sh`。","locale":"zh-CN"},"503":{"id":"/docs/shell-7","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell","content":"加 `--completions` 可同时注册 Tab 补全；普通初始化默认不启用。支持 PowerShell、Bash、Zsh，Zsh 需先初始化 `compinit`。也可以用独立的 `hanamori completions`，详见终端补全。","locale":"zh-CN"},"504":{"id":"/docs/shell-8","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell#自动检测与目录选择","content":"`env` 和 `shell init/deinit/activate/deactivate` 不指定 `--shell` 时，沿父进程链最多查找 16 层，选择最近的受支持 Shell。支持 Bash、Zsh、PowerShell、CMD，不使用可能已过时的 `$SHELL` 或 `COMSPEC`。显式 `--shell` 优先，无法检测则要求明确指定。","locale":"zh-CN"},"505":{"id":"/docs/shell-9","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell#自动检测与目录选择","content":"管理目录按每次命令的 `--manager-dir` → `HANAMORI_HOME` → 平台默认目录选择；Windows 默认为 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Hanamori`。生成钩子或初始化脚本时传入的 `--manager-dir` 不会固定后续命令的管理目录。需要自定义长期使用的目录，在启动配置中设置 `HANAMORI_HOME`。`env --dir PATH` 可为未显式指定选择器的调用保存工具链目录默认值，不会注册目录。","locale":"zh-CN"},"506":{"id":"/docs/shell-10","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell#会话语义","content":"`use`、`exec --using` 与 `shell activate` 共用本地选择。A → B 的切换保留激活 A 之前的环境基线，不积累编译路径；`deactivate` 恢复这一基线。只编译器组合会清除注入的 SDK 值，无关环境变量不变。在 Shell 支持时，空值与未设置仍有区别。","locale":"zh-CN"},"507":{"id":"/docs/shell-11","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell#会话语义","content":"`current` 读取已经激活的快照，不重新解析项目或 default。不同终端可以使用不同组合。`current`、退出激活和恢复操作不依赖有效的全局配置，也能在安装目录已丢失时用于诊断或恢复环境。","locale":"zh-CN"},"508":{"id":"/docs/shell-12","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell#随项目自动切换","content":"选择对应 Shell 的一条，重新打开终端后生效。临时加载也可以给 `env` 加上 `--use-on-cd`。它包含启动时的首次选择，无需再加 `--auto-activate`，并且不能与固定工具链目录的 `--dir` 同用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"509":{"id":"/docs/shell-13","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell#随项目自动切换","content":"每次目录变化，从当前目录向上寻找最近的 `hanamori-toolchain.json`；嵌套项目覆盖父项目。没有项目配置时使用 `default`，两者都没有时保持当前环境。配置错误、匹配不唯一或工具链缺失会报告错误并保留环境，不自动下载。目标工具链未变时不重复修改环境或打印提示。","locale":"zh-CN"},"510":{"id":"/docs/shell-14","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell#随项目自动切换","content":"Zsh 在目录变化时立即处理；Bash 和 PowerShell 在返回提示符时检测目录，因此 `cd project; build` 同一行中的 `build` 不会等待自动切换。脚本或同一行连续命令请使用 `hanamori exec` / `hanamori run`。PowerShell 仅处理文件系统目录；初始化区块应放在提示符主题设置之后。","locale":"zh-CN"},"511":{"id":"/docs/shell-15","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell#随项目自动切换","content":"手动 `use` 或 `deactivate` 会保留到下一次目录变化。重复加载不会重复注册钩子；重新加载不带 `--use-on-cd` 的钩子可以停止自动切换，保留当前环境。仅修改当前目录的配置文件不会自动刷新，可执行 `hanamori use`。CMD 的支持范围见 CMD 集成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"512":{"id":"/docs/shell-16","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell#一次性脚本","content":"脚本需要在调用者 Shell 中加载，子进程无法直接修改父进程环境。`--plain` 输出 `KEY=VALUE` 供检查，跳过 Shell 检测；它不是激活脚本，与 `--shell`、`--output` 互斥。生成失败不覆盖已有输出文件。没有加载钩子就执行 `use` 会提示初始化方式。","locale":"zh-CN"},"513":{"id":"/docs/shell-17","page_id":"/docs/shell","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/shell#一次性脚本","content":"继续阅读：PowerShell、Bash/Zsh、CMD、持久启动配置。","locale":"zh-CN"},"514":{"id":"/docs/support","page_id":"/docs/support","type":"page","content":"支持范围","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","开始"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/support","locale":"zh-CN"},"515":{"id":"/docs/support-0","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"区分程序构建、Shell 集成和真实 MSVC 编译能力。","locale":"zh-CN"},"516":{"id":"/docs/support-1","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"项目","locale":"zh-CN"},"517":{"id":"/docs/support-2","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"当前范围","locale":"zh-CN"},"518":{"id":"/docs/support-3","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"原生编译","locale":"zh-CN"},"519":{"id":"/docs/support-4","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"Windows x64 / ARM64 主机，x64 / ARM64 目标","locale":"zh-CN"},"520":{"id":"/docs/support-5","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"发布与自我更新","locale":"zh-CN"},"521":{"id":"/docs/support-6","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"`x86_64-pc-windows-msvc` / `aarch64-pc-windows-msvc`，EXE 和 ZIP","locale":"zh-CN"},"522":{"id":"/docs/support-7","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"Shell","locale":"zh-CN"},"523":{"id":"/docs/support-8","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"PowerShell 5.1/7、Bash、Zsh；CMD 为实验性支持","locale":"zh-CN"},"524":{"id":"/docs/support-9","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"Windows POSIX Shell","locale":"zh-CN"},"525":{"id":"/docs/support-10","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"MSYS 路径转换依赖当前运行时的 `cygpath`","locale":"zh-CN"},"526":{"id":"/docs/support-11","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"Linux/其他 Unix","locale":"zh-CN"},"527":{"id":"/docs/support-12","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"可用于源码开发和部分逻辑、Shell 测试，不代表原生运行 MSVC","locale":"zh-CN"},"528":{"id":"/docs/support-13","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"工具链组合","locale":"zh-CN"},"529":{"id":"/docs/support-14","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"独立 MSVC/SDK 目录；可不安装 SDK；不共享已安装 SDK 文件","locale":"zh-CN"},"530":{"id":"/docs/support-15","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"项目提供 `run` 执行别名、`completions` 命令和可选的 `--use-on-cd` 项目自动切换，尚未提供 GUI、ARM32/ARM64EC 目标或跨管理器引用计数。初始化钩子默认不会自动激活；`--auto-activate` 在非活动会话加载时尝试一次，`--use-on-cd` 还会在目录变化时重新选择。各 Shell 的触发方式见 Shell 集成。","locale":"zh-CN"},"531":{"id":"/docs/support-16","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"本地自动化检查、交叉编译和 Windows 原生验收是不同证据。验收方法见测试与原生验收，不要把构建通过等同于所有 Shell 和真实编译器组合均已验收。","locale":"zh-CN"},"532":{"id":"/docs/support-17","page_id":"/docs/support","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/support","content":"ARM64 Host 工具需要 Windows 11 ARM64。微软从 VS 2022 17.4 开始提供原生 ARM64 Visual Studio 工具，详见 Visual Studio on Arm devices。Hanamori 分别选择 Host 编译器与 Target 库。","locale":"zh-CN"},"533":{"id":"/docs/testing","page_id":"/docs/testing","type":"page","content":"测试与原生验收","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/testing","locale":"zh-CN"},"534":{"id":"/docs/testing-0","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"运行既有检查，区分本地逻辑测试与真实 Windows 工具链验收。","locale":"zh-CN"},"535":{"id":"/docs/testing-1","page_id":"/docs/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/testing#解包回归","content":"解包回归","locale":"zh-CN"},"536":{"id":"/docs/testing-2","page_id":"/docs/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/testing#windows-原生工具链","content":"Windows 原生工具链","locale":"zh-CN"},"537":{"id":"/docs/testing-3","page_id":"/docs/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/testing#msbuild-原生验收","content":"MSBuild 原生验收","locale":"zh-CN"},"538":{"id":"/docs/testing-4","page_id":"/docs/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/testing#架构验收","content":"架构验收","locale":"zh-CN"},"539":{"id":"/docs/testing-5","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"PowerShell 中先设置 `$env:HANAMORI_REQUIRE_SHELL_TESTS = '1'`，再运行 Cargo。既有 CI 覆盖 Linux 与 Windows，测试使用真实实现、本地 HTTP 服务、合成安装包和实际可用 Shell。必需 Shell 模式避免把缺少运行时当成成功覆盖。","locale":"zh-CN"},"540":{"id":"/docs/testing-6","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"main 推送和 PR 仅在 Rust 源码、Rust 测试、工作区包、Cargo/工具链配置或相关发布自动化发生变化时触发 Rust CI。根目录安装脚本和 `tests/installers/` 由 Installers 工作流单独检查；Rust 源码和构建配置变化也会触发安装集成验证。Website 工作流检查 `site/`，并在安装脚本变化时重新生成分发产物。只修改 README、网站或安装脚本不触发 Rust CI。Release 对 Rust CI 和 Installers 的复用调用使用同一提交，发布前必须全部通过，不受变更路径过滤影响。","locale":"zh-CN"},"541":{"id":"/docs/testing-7","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"普通本地检查可以直接运行 `cargo test --workspace`。缺少可选 Shell 时会明确报告跳过；显式配置的运行时必须可用。Windows Bash/Zsh 用例需要带 `cygpath` 的 Git Bash 或 MSYS2，不使用 WSL。测试子进程保留可用的 Windows 临时目录，同时隔离父进程的 Hanamori 状态和配置；CMD 生命周期用例使用精简的系统 PATH，避免开发机已安装工具占用批处理命令长度。","locale":"zh-CN"},"542":{"id":"/docs/testing-8","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"安装脚本测试入口为 `tests/installers/run.mjs`，仅使用 Node 内置模块，不需要安装网站依赖。以下命令需要 Node、Bash 和 PowerShell 7，不需要 Cargo 或 Hanamori EXE，覆盖参数与平台检查、Release 元数据、架构资产选择和损坏下载保留旧文件：","locale":"zh-CN"},"543":{"id":"/docs/testing-9","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"Windows 集成测试接收已构建的真实 EXE，不在测试入口内调用 Cargo。以原生 x64 为例：","locale":"zh-CN"},"544":{"id":"/docs/testing-10","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"原生 ARM64 使用 `aarch64-pc-windows-msvc`，同时替换构建目标、EXE 路径和测试目标。版本、大小和 SHA-256 从输入 EXE 获取。本地 HTTP 服务提供 Release 和程序下载，Profile 与注册表键均隔离。PowerShell 5.1/7 覆盖首次与重复安装、Unicode 路径、PATH 保留、跳过选项，以及下载、哈希、大小或版本验证失败时保留旧程序。Git Bash/MSYS2 分别验证管道入口、两种路径格式、重复安装、失败保留、跳过选项和新 Bash 会话加载 Hook。","locale":"zh-CN"},"545":{"id":"/docs/testing-11","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"安装测试用 `HANAMORI_TEST_POWERSHELL`、`HANAMORI_TEST_PWSH` 和 `HANAMORI_TEST_BASH` 指定运行时；Bash 也查询 PATH、PATH 中 Git 所属安装目录和默认 Git 安装目录。额外的 MSYS2 使用 `HANAMORI_TEST_MSYS2_BASH` 或系统盘的 `msys64/usr/bin/bash.exe`。省略 `--require-shells` 时，本地缺少默认运行时会明确报告跳过；显式指定的运行时缺失始终失败，全部跳过也会失败。`--require-shells` 要求该套件的主要 Shell 全部可用；额外的 MSYS2 若未显式指定且不可用，仍会单独报告跳过。Windows CI 显式选择 Git Bash；x64 还显式要求 MSYS2，ARM64 使用可用的额外 MSYS2。","locale":"zh-CN"},"546":{"id":"/docs/testing-12","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"`cargo test --workspace` 不执行根目录安装脚本测试。CLI 的工具链安装、自卸载、Shell 集成和补全仍由 Rust 测试；库测试继续验证安装记录的 PATH 清理，不修改真实用户 PATH。网站保持独立的 build/check/test，见网站维护。","locale":"zh-CN"},"547":{"id":"/docs/testing-13","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"终端补全可以单独运行 `cargo test --locked -p hanamori --test cli completions::`。测试覆盖真实 Bash 候选、Zsh 行编辑器的 Tab 补全、PowerShell 的 `CompleteInput`，以及独立脚本、钩子、启动配置、重复加载、隐藏命令和 `exec --`。Windows 另外运行 PowerShell 5.1；Bash/Zsh 优先使用显式路径，再查询 PATH；Bash 还检查 PATH 中 Git 所属安装目录和 `ProgramFiles/Git/bin/bash.exe`。可通过 `HANAMORI_TEST_BASH`、`HANAMORI_TEST_ZSH` 指定本机运行时。Windows Zsh 缺失时明确跳过；设置覆盖路径后则必须可用。升级 `clap_complete` 后应重新验证这些脚本生成与实际 Shell 用例。","locale":"zh-CN"},"548":{"id":"/docs/testing-14","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"动态补全回归另见 `cargo test --locked -p hanamori --test cli completions::dynamic::`，使用实际目录和外部引用检查选择器、版本歧义、管理器优先级、直接目录、单个损坏引用和只读行为。`completions` 测试也验证真实 Bash Readline/Zsh 行编辑器、PowerShell 中的动态候选、带空格路径、等号参数、HOME 变化和退出码保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"549":{"id":"/docs/testing-15","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing","content":"动态解析使用固定版本的 `clap_complete` Rust 引擎；其 `unstable-dynamic` 功能不作为公开 Shell 协议。内部 `shell complete` 只查询候选，Shell 适配模板在 `src/commands/completions/`，静态命令补全继续由同一 Clap 树生成。升级依赖时同时验证静态模板适配和动态解析，不手工修改生成的脚本。","locale":"zh-CN"},"550":{"id":"/docs/testing-16","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#解包回归","content":"运行 `cargo test --locked -p hanamori --lib --test api` 可检查解包、发布和目录发现。CAB 回归使用真实 MSZIP 归档和解码器，统计底层读取字节数，防止逐文件从头解压；同时覆盖跨压缩文件夹、跳过区间、空文件、损坏校验和及缺失文件。SDK 测试检查暂存位置、失败清理和实际文件进度，事务测试检查替换成功、准备失败保留原目录，以及中断后的旧目录还原。`cli` 测试中的 `install` 模块还覆盖删除整套目录、cl.exe、SDK 库或整个 Windows Kits 后重装，非必要文件损坏用 `--reinstall` 修复，外部目录替换授权与失败保留。","locale":"zh-CN"},"551":{"id":"/docs/testing-17","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#解包回归","content":"合成归档的读取量可以验证算法是否重复工作，但不能直接代表 Windows 上安装真实 MSVC/SDK 的耗时。实际性能验收需记录版本、磁盘、缓存状态及下载和解包各阶段耗时，并确认最终工具链可用。","locale":"zh-CN"},"552":{"id":"/docs/testing-18","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#windows-原生工具链","content":"先安装或导入两套真实 MSVC/SDK，编译器和 SDK 目录版本都应不同。从 list 获取目录键或使用命名引用：","locale":"zh-CN"},"553":{"id":"/docs/testing-19","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#windows-原生工具链","content":"该默认忽略的验收会依次 A → B（继承 A）→ A，从隔离的环境中按名称调用 `rc.exe` 编译资源，再编译、链接包含 Windows/标准头文件、静态 CRT、SDK 库的程序，最后用 `mt.exe` 嵌入清单。运行生成的程序会检查资源内容、嵌入的清单、不同且稳定的编译器指纹和未修改的引用，覆盖含空格和 Unicode 的路径。不下载或删除工具链；输入缺失、非 Windows 会明确失败。","locale":"zh-CN"},"554":{"id":"/docs/testing-20","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#windows-原生工具链","content":"交叉编译、Linux 合成测试和 Wine 不能代替原生验收。PowerShell 5.1/7、Git Bash/Zsh、CMD/AutoRun、独立终端、跨卷操作、文件占用时保留旧目录均需分别验证并记录结果。","locale":"zh-CN"},"555":{"id":"/docs/testing-21","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#windows-原生工具链","content":"网站检查见网站维护，不要求为了修改 MDX 重新运行全部 Rust 测试。","locale":"zh-CN"},"556":{"id":"/docs/testing-22","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#msbuild-原生验收","content":"普通回归使用 `cargo test --locked -p hanamori --test cli install::msbuild`，覆盖 VS 2022/2026 的 VSIX/MSI/CAB 提取路径、FileTracker 整理、独立目录、项目要求、缺失修复、失败回滚及 MSBuild → 普通组合 → MSBuild 的环境恢复。合成归档不包含可执行的 MSBuild。","locale":"zh-CN"},"557":{"id":"/docs/testing-23","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#msbuild-原生验收","content":"在没有 Visual Studio/Build Tools 的 Windows x64 / ARM64 主机上，为 A 指定 `--vs-version 2022`、B 使用默认 VS 2026，选择不同的编译器和 SDK 版本并按默认组件安装（包含 MSBuild），设置同样的三个环境变量后执行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"558":{"id":"/docs/testing-24","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#msbuild-原生验收","content":"此入口按 A → B（继承 A）→ A 构建带静态库项目引用的 `.vcxproj` 和 `.sln`，覆盖 Debug/Release、资源、清单、增量编译、修改库后重新链接、Clean/Rebuild，并检查编译器、SDK、targets 的求值路径均位于所选安装下。错误的显式 SDK 版本必须失败。构建使用 `-nr:false`，日志在该次临时构建目录内。","locale":"zh-CN"},"559":{"id":"/docs/testing-25","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#msbuild-原生验收","content":"还需在装有其他 Visual Studio 的 Windows 主机重复，确认不会借用系统组件，并在 PowerShell、Git Bash/MSYS2 中运行安装文档的构建命令。MSBuild 示例使用 `-p:`、`-t:`；直接调用 `cl` 的 `/link` 被 MSYS2 改写时，用单次命令 `MSYS2_ARG_CONV_EXCL='*' cl ...`，该问题不通过增装 MSBuild 解决。当前 Linux 环境只完成下载解包与自动回归，以上原生验收仍待执行。","locale":"zh-CN"},"560":{"id":"/docs/testing-26","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#架构验收","content":"CI 包含 Linux、原生 Windows x64 和 `windows-11-arm`。解包测试覆盖 VS 2022/2026 的四种 Host/Target 组合、MSBuild、独立目录身份及必要文件检查。","locale":"zh-CN"},"561":{"id":"/docs/testing-27","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#架构验收","content":"在能够运行对应编译器的 Windows 主机上安装组合，将 `HANAMORI_TEST_MANAGER_DIR` 和 `HANAMORI_TEST_TOOLCHAIN_A` 指向该安装，然后运行：","locale":"zh-CN"},"562":{"id":"/docs/testing-28","page_id":"/docs/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/testing#架构验收","content":"此验收使用真实编译器编译链接 C/C++，并通过 MSBuild 构建 `.vcxproj`；检查输出 PE Machine（`0x8664` 或 `0xaa64`），操作系统支持目标架构时运行结果。在 x64 Windows 验证 x64/arm64，在 Windows 11 ARM64 验证 arm64/arm64、arm64/x64 和 x64/arm64。原有双工具链验收也支持 ARM64，并使用所选组合的 MSBuild 平台。Linux 解包验证不能替代 Windows 原生验收。","locale":"zh-CN"},"563":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"故障排查","breadcrumbs":["Hanamori 文档","维护与参考"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/troubleshooting","locale":"zh-CN"},"564":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting","content":"根据实际错误选择检查与恢复步骤。","locale":"zh-CN"},"565":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting","content":"症状","locale":"zh-CN"},"566":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting","content":"处理顺序","locale":"zh-CN"},"567":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/troubleshooting","content":"Tab 没有补全候选","locale":"zh-CN"},"568":{"id":"/docs/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/d