,"1223":820,"1224":838,"1225":13,"1226":798,"1227":776,"1228":824,"1229":700,"1230":730,"1231":832,"1232":579,"1233":420,"1234":369,"1235":780,"1236":436,"1237":139,"1238":223,"1239":525,"1240":256,"1241":470,"1242":796,"1243":784,"1244":427,"1245":792,"1246":381},"orderedDocs":[[19,"—"],[23,"—"],[651,"—"],[655,"—"],[334,"`--` 后必须有可执行程序，后续参数按原始 argv 传递，不解释管道、重定向、通配符、变量或 Shell 内建命令。需要这些语法时，显式运行 Shell，例如："],[788,"`--all --json` returns `{ \"catalogs\": [...] }`. Each entry includes `vs_version`, `channel`, `manifest_url`, and the existing single-source fields `toolsets`, `sdks`, `selected_toolset_id`, and `packages`. A failure in either source fails the whole command without printing a partial list. The warning/strict manifest-integrity policy applies to both sources."],[989,"`--all --json` returns `{ \"catalogs\": [...] }`. Each entry includes `vs_version`, `channel`, `manifest_url`, and the existing single-source fields `toolsets`, `sdks`, `selected_toolset_id`, and `packages`. A failure in either source fails the whole command without printing a partial list. The warning/strict manifest-integrity policy applies to both sources."],[156,"`--all --json` 输出 `{ \"catalogs\": [...] }`；每组包含 `vs_version`、`channel`、`manifest_url`，以及单源查询已有的 `toolsets`、`sdks`、`selected_toolset_id` 和 `packages`。任意来源查询失败会使整个命令失败，不输出部分列表；默认警告/严格清单校验策略对两个来源均生效。"],[364,"`--all --json` 输出 `{ \"catalogs\": [...] }`；每组包含 `vs_version`、`channel`、`manifest_url`，以及单源查询已有的 `toolsets`、`sdks`、`selected_toolset_id` 和 `packages`。任意来源查询失败会使整个命令失败，不输出部分列表；默认警告/严格清单校验策略对两个来源均生效。"],[148,"`--arch ARCH`"],[780,"`--arch ARCH`"],[295,"`--cache-dir` / `cache_dir`"],[923,"`--cache-dir` / `cache_dir`"],[1225,"`--check` reports the current version, latest version and executable path without\ndownloading an executable or writing files. An equal version normally needs no update;\n`--force` allows reinstalling it. Neither mode downgrades a newer build, selects a\nprerelease, or bypasses verification. `--check` and `--force` cannot be combined."],[209,"`--check` 或 `--force`，互斥；仅 Windows x64 / ARM64 MSVC"],[1036,"`--completions` opts into generating fresh completion with the hook on every startup.\nKeep it when updating initialization; omitting it restores hook-only loading. In Zsh,\nplace the managed block after `compinit` or your framework's completion setup.\nDeinit and self uninstall clean the whole block using existing ownership records;\nrestart the shell to remove completion already loaded in memory.\nSee terminal completion."],[413,"`--completions` 将补全一并加入动态 loader，每次启动重新生成，默认关闭。再次初始化时保留此参数，否则会恢复为仅加载钩子。Zsh 的受管理区块应位于 `compinit` 或框架的补全初始化之后。`shell deinit` 和自身卸载会按原有归属记录清理整个区块，当前会话的补全需重开终端才移除。详见终端补全。"],[310,"`--connections` / `connections`"],[938,"`--connections` / `connections`"],[255,"`--dir PATH --sdk`"],[883,"`--dir PATH --sdk`"],[253,"`--dir PATH --toolset`"],[881,"`--dir PATH --toolset`"],[835,"`--dir PATH`, `--json`; read-only, nonzero when errors exist"],[203,"`--dir PATH`、`--json`；只诊断，有错误时非零退出"],[130,"`--dir/-d PATH`"],[762,"`--dir/-d PATH`"],[994,"`--dir` installs a portable toolchain. A missing or empty destination is accepted. Replacing a nonempty external directory requires `--reinstall`, which replaces that entire directory; keep personal files elsewhere. Portable installations are discovered through an explicit `--dir` or an external reference. Uninstall does not delete external reference targets."],[370,"`--dir` 是便携安装：接受不存在或空目录；非空外部目录须明确指定 `--reinstall`，这会替换整个目录，请勿存放个人文件。通过显式 `--dir` 或外部引用使用便携安装；uninstall 不删除外部引用目标。"],[298,"`--download-dir` / `download_dir`"],[926,"`--download-dir` / `download_dir`"],[743,"`--download-dir` selects a separate persistent workspace for unfinished, resumable downloads. It is not the complete cache. The default workspace is temporary; selecting `--cache-dir` does not preserve incomplete fragments automatically."],[111,"`--download-dir` 指定的是独立的持久下载工作区，用于未完成、可续传的下载。它不是完整缓存。默认工作区是临时的，设置 `--cache-dir` 不会自动保留未完成片段。"],[150,"`--dry-run`"],[782,"`--dry-run`"],[995,"`--dry-run` may fetch catalog metadata but does not download payloads or create directories. Manifest checksum/size mismatches warn by default; `--strict-manifest-integrity` rejects them. Payload verification remains enabled. Each toolchain has its own SDK; the download cache shares payloads."],[371,"`--dry-run` 可能读取清单，但不下载工具链负载、不创建目录。清单哈希或大小不一致默认告警，`--strict-manifest-integrity` 改为错误。负载完整性校验始终启用。不同组合各自保存 SDK，共享下载缓存。"],[837,"`--dry-run`, `--json`; clean idle complete cache payloads"],[831,"`--dry-run`, `--json`; delete a named reference and preserve files"],[833,"`--dry-run`, `--json`; delete an entire managed directory and its references; external directories are rejected"],[843,"`--dry-run`, `--purge`; preserves manager data by default; no json"],[199,"`--dry-run`、`--json`；删除命名引用，保留目录"],[201,"`--dry-run`、`--json`；删除整个托管目录及指向它的引用；不接受外部目录"],[205,"`--dry-run`、`--json`；清理闲置完整缓存负载"],[211,"`--dry-run`、`--purge`；默认保留管理器数据，无 json 选项"],[307,"`--file-workers` / `file_workers`"],[935,"`--file-workers` / `file_workers`"],[744,"`--file-workers` controls concurrent payloads; `--connections` controls connections per payload. Defaults are 4 and 8. `--mirror` changes the payload host/base path with fallback to the original URL. See configuration for fields and precedence."],[112,"`--file-workers` 限制并行 payload 数，`--connections` 限制每个 payload 的连接数。默认分别为 4 和 8。`--mirror` 替换负载主机/基础路径，失败时回退到原始 URL。具体字段及来源优先级见配置。"],[313,"`--log` / `log`"],[941,"`--log` / `log`"],[304,"`--mirror` / `mirror`"],[932,"`--mirror` / `mirror`"],[142,"`--msbuild`"],[774,"`--msbuild`"],[132,"`--name ALIAS`"],[764,"`--name ALIAS`"],[144,"`--no-msbuild`"],[776,"`--no-msbuild`"],[140,"`--no-sdk`"],[772,"`--no-sdk`"],[1037,"`--profile PATH` selects a specific startup file; `--shell-executable` selects the\nruntime used for profile discovery. With automatic detection, discovery uses the detected\nexecutable, so PowerShell 7 selects its own profile rather than Windows PowerShell 5.1's.\nIf `--shell` is omitted, a recognizable `--shell-executable` name also selects the shell\ntype; explicit `--shell` takes precedence. An explicit `--profile` overrides profile\ndiscovery. For renamed runtimes, specify `--shell` and `--shell-executable` together.\nInitialization stores a loader that calls\n`env`, not a fixed toolchain snapshot. Managed blocks preserve surrounding bytes, encoding\nand newline style. Repeated init/deinit is stable. Bash setup maintains the interactive\nentry and an appropriate login-profile bridge; Zsh respects `ZDOTDIR`. Deinit affects\nfuture sessions and does not deactivate an open terminal."],[414,"`--profile PATH` 明确指定文件；`--shell-executable` 选择用于发现启动文件的运行时，二者互斥。自动检测会使用实际发现的 Shell 程序，区分 PowerShell 5.1 与 7。未指定 `--shell` 时，可识别的运行时文件名也能确定类型；重命名的程序应同时指定类型与运行时路径。"],[301,"`--proxy` / `proxy`"],[929,"`--proxy` / `proxy`"],[1108,"`--purge` removes discovered managed toolchain directories under the configured `toolchains_dir`, including incomplete trees. It cleans complete payloads from the configured cache and deletes named references and `config.json`. External imports and directories created by `install --dir` lose their references but keep their files. Managers configured to share the same toolchain storage also share these physical directories, so removal affects them all. A managed directory is removed in full; keep unrelated files elsewhere. Move the executable or manager outside a managed toolchain before purging it. Unknown files, partial download workspaces, profile backups and lock files\n(including `.update.lock`) are retained; remaining directories are not recursively erased.\nA shared cache may lose complete payloads, as with `cache clean`."],[493,"`--purge` 复用工具链卸载和缓存清理的文件占用处理。工具链或缓存清理失败时，停止删除程序和剩余管理器元数据；先前已完成的卸载不回滚。按错误提示处理后重试；不完整的托管目录仍可再次卸载。预览不写文件、改注册表、取锁、关闭进程或启动辅助进程。"],[488,"`--purge` 额外删除当前 `toolchains_dir` 下发现的托管工具链，包括不完整的目录；清理配置指定缓存的完整负载，最后删除命名引用与 `config.json`。外部导入或 `install --dir` 创建的目录只移除引用，实体文件不删除。若多个管理器配置为同一个工具链存储目录，它们共享这些实体目录；清理也会影响它们。共享缓存可能失去完整负载，与 `cache clean` 相同。"],[1084,"`--push` pushes only the created tag to `origin`, triggering both release channels. If the\npush fails, the local tag is retained and the command prints the `git push` command to retry."],[464,"`--push` 仅将刚创建的标签推送到 `origin`，触发两个发布渠道。推送失败时保留本地标签，并输出可重试的 `git push` 命令。"],[146,"`--reinstall`"],[778,"`--reinstall`"],[136,"`--sdk VER`"],[768,"`--sdk VER`"],[138,"`--sdk-id ID`"],[770,"`--sdk-id ID`"],[814,"`--shell/-s SHELL`, `--output/-o PATH`, `--auto-activate`, `--use-on-cd`, `--completions`, hook toolchain directory defaults"],[812,"`--shell/-s SHELL`, `--output/-o PATH`; generates completion without loading a toolchain hook"],[182,"`--shell/-s SHELL`、`--output/-o PATH`、`--auto-activate`、`--use-on-cd`、`--completions`，以及钩子工具链目录默认值"],[180,"`--shell/-s SHELL`、`--output/-o PATH`；生成补全，不加载工具链钩子"],[240,"`--shell/-s` 省略时自动检测，失败时要求显式指定。没有 `--output/-o` 时 stdout 只包含注册脚本；写入文件后需在相应 Shell 中加载它。生成的 Zsh 文件用于显式 `source`，不需要复制到系统补全目录。手工保存的脚本不会自动更新，升级后应重新生成并重新加载；重开终端可清除旧补全定义。"],[822,"`--shell/-s`, `--output/-o`"],[816,"`--shell/-s`, `--profile PATH` or `--shell-executable PATH`, `--auto-activate`, `--use-on-cd`, `--completions`, `--dry-run`, hook toolchain directory defaults"],[818,"`--shell/-s`, `--profile` or `--shell-executable`, `--dry-run`"],[190,"`--shell/-s`、`--output/-o`"],[184,"`--shell/-s`、`--profile PATH` 或 `--shell-executable PATH`、`--auto-activate`、`--use-on-cd`、`--completions`、`--dry-run`、钩子工具链目录默认值"],[186,"`--shell/-s`、`--profile` 或 `--shell-executable`、`--dry-run`"],[292,"`--toolchains-dir` / `toolchains_dir`"],[920,"`--toolchains-dir` / `toolchains_dir`"],[134,"`--toolset-id ID`"],[766,"`--toolset-id ID`"],[1035,"`--use-on-cd` opts into project toolchain selection at startup and on directory changes.\nKeep this flag when updating initialization; omitting it disables tracking on subsequent\nloads. In PowerShell, place initialization after prompt theme setup. See\nShell integration for behavior and shell differences."],[412,"`--use-on-cd` 开启启动及目录变化时的项目工具链选择，默认关闭。更新初始化时需保留此参数，否则后续启动恢复为不自动切换。PowerShell 中请将初始化区块放在提示符主题设置之后。行为和 Shell 差异见 Shell 集成。"],[888,"`--using=prefix` and quoted/escaped paths are supported. Completion interprets literal arguments before the cursor without executing variable expansions or command expressions. Use `HANAMORI_HOME` when selecting a manager through such expressions."],[986,"`--vs-version` accepts `2022`/`17` and `2026`/`18`. `--channel` accepts `release`/`stable`\nand `preview`/`insiders`. A custom `--manifest` replaces both. The default is 2026 stable (`release`).\n`--arch HOST/TARGET` supports `x64/x64`, `x64/arm64`, `arm64/x64` and `arm64/arm64`.\nThe default follows the native Windows architecture, even when Hanamori itself runs under emulation.\nAn explicit `--arch` overrides project `host`/`target`; otherwise the project takes precedence over the native default.\nThe compiler host selects executable tools and MSBuild; the target selects CRT/SDK libraries and the MSBuild platform.\nAn ARM64-hosted compiler needs Windows 11 ARM64. ARM32 and ARM64EC are not supported."],[361,"`--vs-version` 支持 `2022`/`17`、`2026`/`18`；`--channel` 支持 `release`/`stable`、`preview`/`insiders`。默认 VS 2026 stable（`release`）。`--manifest URL` 替代二者，不能同时指定。`--arch HOST/TARGET` 支持 `x64/x64`、`x64/arm64`、`arm64/x64` 和 `arm64/arm64`。\n默认使用 Windows 原生架构，即使 Hanamori 本身运行在仿真环境中。显式 `--arch` 优先于项目的 `host`/`target`，项目配置优先于原生默认值。\nHost 决定编译器、SDK 工具和 MSBuild 的运行架构，Target 决定 CRT/SDK 库和 MSBuild 平台。\nARM64 Host 需要 Windows 11 ARM64；不支持 ARM32 或 ARM64EC。"],[87,"`-InstallDir`"],[718,"`-InstallDir`"],[89,"`-NoPathUpdate`"],[720,"`-NoPathUpdate`"],[91,"`-NoShell`"],[722,"`-NoShell`"],[85,"`-Version`"],[716,"`-Version`"],[297,"`<manager>/cache`"],[925,"`<manager>/cache`"],[294,"`<manager>/toolchains`"],[922,"`<manager>/toolchains`"],[163,"`alias [SELECTOR NAME] [--json]`"],[795,"`alias [SELECTOR NAME] [--json]`"],[636,"`alias SELECTOR NAME` accepts a managed key, reference, external `@name` key or unique actual-version prefix. It creates or updates a name. `default stable` copies stable's target: redirecting stable later does not change default or an active session."],[4,"`alias SELECTOR NAME` 支持受管目录键、引用、外部 `@name` 键或唯一实际版本前缀，创建或更新名字。`default stable` 复制 stable 当前的目标；之后重定向 stable，不改变 default 或已激活终端。"],[1091,"`all` (default) publishes both channels; `github` publishes only GitHub Release assets; `crates-io` publishes only the crate."],[471,"`all`（默认）同时发布两个渠道；`github` 只发布 GitHub Release；`crates-io` 只发布 crate。"],[21,"`archive`"],[653,"`archive`"],[204,"`cache clean`"],[391,"`cache clean`"],[836,"`cache clean`"],[1014,"`cache clean`"],[1155,"`cargo test --locked -p hanamori --test cli completions::dynamic::` uses real directories and imported references\nto check selectors, ambiguous versions, manager precedence, direct directory selection,\nisolated broken references and read-only behavior. The shell suite also covers dynamic candidates,\nquoted paths, equals-form options, HOME changes and exit-code preservation in Bash\nReadline, Zsh's line editor and PowerShell."],[1169,"`cargo test --locked -p hanamori --test cli install::msbuild` covers VS 2022/2026 extraction paths using synthetic VSIX/MSI/CAB files, private FileTracker placement, independent combinations, project requirements, missing-file repair, rollback and MSBuild → ordinary → MSBuild environment restoration. Those archives contain no executable MSBuild."],[1164,"`cargo test --workspace` does not execute root installer tests. Toolchain installation,\nself-uninstall, shell integration and completions remain Rust tests. Library tests still\ncover receipt-based PATH cleanup without editing the user's real PATH. Website build,\ntype checking and tests remain independent; see Website maintenance."],[546,"`cargo test --workspace` 不执行根目录安装脚本测试。CLI 的工具链安装、自卸载、Shell 集成和补全仍由 Rust 测试；库测试继续验证安装记录的 PATH 清理，不修改真实用户 PATH。网站保持独立的 build/check/test，见网站维护。"],[1083,"`cargo xtask tag` creates an annotated `vVERSION` tag at `HEAD` without pushing. The default\nis the current workspace version, not the highest existing Git tag. An explicit version is\nalso supported, for example `cargo xtask tag 0.1.2 --push`; it must match the workspace version.\nTracked changes must be committed, and an existing tag is never replaced."],[463,"`cargo xtask tag` 在 `HEAD` 创建带注释的 `v版本号` 标签，默认不推送。默认版本来自当前工作区，而非已有 Git 标签中的最高版本。也可显式指定版本，例如 `cargo xtask tag 0.1.2 --push`；指定值必须与工作区版本一致。已跟踪文件的修改必须先提交，已有标签不会被覆盖。"],[25,"`catalog`"],[657,"`catalog`"],[677,"`cli`, `commands`, `config`, `logging`, `runtime`, `self_uninstall`, `upgrade`"],[45,"`cli`、`commands`、`config`、`logging`、`runtime`、`self_uninstall`、`upgrade`"],[850,"`cmd /d` bypasses AutoRun; explicitly call the generated entry in that case. Existing\nAutoRun content is preserved. `--profile` and `--shell-executable` are not CMD registry\nselectors. Loader files are retained for open sessions after deinit. Native acceptance\nof code pages, quoting, AutoRun and interactive behavior remains a separate gate."],[179,"`completions`"],[811,"`completions`"],[825,"`completions`, `env --completions` and `shell init --completions` support PowerShell, Bash and Zsh; CMD returns an explicit error. Completion is opt-in, reads only manager/toolchain storage configuration and does not use the network, and requires `compinit` in Zsh. Local selectors, existing aliases and component versions in an explicit directory are completed dynamically using the current command/environment manager selection. See terminal completion for value/path support and PowerShell limitations."],[193,"`completions`、`env --completions` 和 `shell init --completions` 仅支持 PowerShell、Bash、Zsh；CMD 明确报错。补全默认关闭，只读取管理器及工具链存储路径相关配置、不联网；Zsh 必须先加载 `compinit`。本地选择器、已有别名及指定目录下的组件版本会动态补全，遵循当前命令和环境的管理目录选择。固定取值、路径和 PowerShell 的能力差异见终端补全。"],[206,"`config show`"],[838,"`config show`"],[945,"`config show` displays effective values in a table. `--resolved` adds source and derived-path information. Scripts should use `--json`, with `--resolved` when source information is needed.\nThe complete payload cache is content-addressed by SHA-256; corrupted entries are fetched\nagain. `--download-dir` is a separate persistent workspace for unfinished/resumable downloads.\nA configured mirror changes the payload host/base; fallback uses the original payload URL.\nCache cleanup skips active or unrecognized entries and does not touch installed tools or\npersistent workspaces. Diagnostics may include complete request URLs; configure credentials\nand handle logs accordingly."],[317,"`config show` 默认以表格展示配置项和有效值；`--resolved` 增加来源及路径派生关系。脚本读取配置时使用 `--json`，需要来源信息时同时指定 `--resolved`。查询、帮助、版本不创建存储。本地选择不解析无关的代理/下载选项；Shell 初始化和恢复有独立路径，不依赖完整配置可用。"],[1237,"`content/docs/PAGE.mdx` is Chinese and `PAGE.en.mdx` is English, each with title/description frontmatter."],[623,"`content/docs/PAGE.mdx` 是中文，`PAGE.en.mdx` 是英文，frontmatter 包含 title 和 description。"],[731,"`curl | bash` runs in a child process. Open a new Bash terminal afterward, or run the printed hook command to use Hanamori immediately in the current terminal. MSYS2 may rebuild PATH at startup; the Bash hook invokes Hanamori by its absolute path."],[100,"`curl | bash` 运行在子进程中。安装后重开 Bash，或执行脚本输出的 Hook 加载命令，让当前终端立即使用 Hanamori。MSYS2 启动时可能重新组织 PATH；Bash Hook 通过程序的绝对路径调用 Hanamori。"],[161,"`current [--json]`"],[793,"`current [--json]`"],[952,"`current` reports the directory key, manager, root and component versions saved by this session. It does not re-resolve changed project files or aliases. `--plain` emits `KEY=VALUE` inspection output for a selected combination; it is not a shell script to source."],[325,"`current` 反映当前会话保存的目录键、管理器、根目录和组件版本，不根据修改后的项目或别名重新计算。`--plain` 是即将选择的组合所生成的 `KEY=VALUE` 检查输出，不可直接当 Shell 脚本加载。"],[507,"`current` 读取已经激活的快照，不重新解析项目或 default。不同终端可以使用不同组合。`current`、退出激活和恢复操作不依赖有效的全局配置，也能在安装目录已丢失时用于诊断或恢复环境。"],[171,"`deactivate`"],[803,"`deactivate`"],[165,"`default [SELECTOR] [--json]`"],[797,"`default [SELECTOR] [--json]`"],[202,"`doctor`"],[834,"`doctor`"],[29,"`download`"],[661,"`download`"],[41,"`engine`"],[673,"`engine`"],[181,"`env`"],[813,"`env`"],[1122,"`env` and `shell init/activate/deactivate/deinit` detect the calling shell when `--shell`\nis omitted. Detection walks up to 16 parent processes, supporting Bash, Zsh, PowerShell\nand CMD. It does not use `$SHELL` or `COMSPEC`, which may describe a different shell.\nAn explicit `--shell` wins; if detection fails, the command asks you to specify it.\nThe generated hooks keep passing an explicit shell for subsequent `use`/`deactivate`."],[504,"`env` 和 `shell init/deinit/activate/deactivate` 不指定 `--shell` 时，沿父进程链最多查找 16 层，选择最近的受支持 Shell。支持 Bash、Zsh、PowerShell、CMD，不使用可能已过时的 `$SHELL` 或 `COMSPEC`。显式 `--shell` 优先，无法检测则要求明确指定。"],[649,"`env`, `msbuild`, `file_usage`, `fs`, `identity`, `locking`, `serde_helpers`, `version`"],[17,"`env`、`msbuild`、`file_usage`、`fs`、`identity`、`locking`、`serde_helpers`、`version`"],[276,"`exec --` 后的内容"],[1130,"`exec --using SELECTOR -- COMMAND [ARGS...]` works in a clean terminal, forwards literal\narguments, inherits streams and preserves the child exit status. Use `--` to separate\nchild options from manager options. It executes argv, not a shell expression: pipes,\nredirection, expansion and builtins require an explicit shell command. In a loaded PowerShell function, quote the separator as `'--'`. Windows PowerShell\nuses the existing encoded argv launcher to preserve empty strings and quotes."],[247,"`exec --using`、`shell activate` 的选择器"],[173,"`exec [--using SELECTOR] -- COMMAND [ARGS...]`"],[805,"`exec [--using SELECTOR] -- COMMAND [ARGS...]`"],[1071,"`exec` needs no shell initialization: only the child receives the compiler environment. Quoting `'--'` in PowerShell also works through an initialized Hanamori wrapper. Expect `Hello from Hanamori!` and a process ID that may change each run."],[960,"`exec` supports registered installations and explicit unregistered directories. `--using` conflicts with `--dir` and its component selectors. With neither, it resolves the nearest project file, then the default. If a directory has multiple combinations, use actual directory versions with `--toolset`, `--sdk` or `--no-sdk`."],[451,"`exec` 不需要 Shell 初始化，编译环境只传递给子进程。PowerShell 中使用 `'--'`，也能兼容已经加载的 Hanamori 包装函数。预期输出包含 `Hello from Hanamori!`，进程 ID 每次可能不同。"],[333,"`exec` 支持注册安装和显式未注册目录。`--using` 与 `--dir` 及其组件参数互斥。不指定选择方式时按最近项目文件、默认别名解析。目录有多个组合时，使用实际目录版本 `--toolset`、`--sdk` 或 `--no-sdk` 消除歧义。"],[680,"`file_usage` encapsulates Windows Restart Manager for individual files and directory trees.\nInstallation replacement, leftover directory cleanup, toolchain uninstall, cache cleanup,\nupdate backup removal and self-uninstall metadata removal share it. Callers retain operation\nlocks and preview handling. The module skips links, never closes its own process and leaves\nother platforms using ordinary file operations."],[53,"`file_usage` 独立封装 Windows Restart Manager，支持单文件和目录树。安装替换、残留目录清理、工具链卸载、缓存清理、自更新备份和自身卸载元数据删除共用它；调用方仍负责操作锁和预览流程。模块不跟随链接，不关闭自身进程，其他平台沿用普通文件操作。"],[909,"`hanamori shell deinit` removes the managed startup block. `self uninstall` uses the same ownership records to clean it up. Loaded functions and completion remain in the current session until you restart the shell. Remove manually saved completion files and handwritten `source` entries yourself."],[281,"`hanamori shell deinit` 会移除受管理启动区块，`self uninstall` 也复用其归属记录清理。已加载的补全和函数留在当前会话，重开终端后消失。手工生成的补全文件及自行添加的 `source` 行需自行删除。"],[296,"`HANAMORI_CACHE_DIR`"],[924,"`HANAMORI_CACHE_DIR`"],[311,"`HANAMORI_CONNECTIONS`"],[939,"`HANAMORI_CONNECTIONS`"],[299,"`HANAMORI_DOWNLOAD_DIR`"],[927,"`HANAMORI_DOWNLOAD_DIR`"],[308,"`HANAMORI_FILE_WORKERS`"],[936,"`HANAMORI_FILE_WORKERS`"],[314,"`HANAMORI_LOG`"],[942,"`HANAMORI_LOG`"],[305,"`HANAMORI_MIRROR`"],[933,"`HANAMORI_MIRROR`"],[302,"`HANAMORI_PROXY`"],[930,"`HANAMORI_PROXY`"],[293,"`HANAMORI_TOOLCHAINS_DIR`"],[921,"`HANAMORI_TOOLCHAINS_DIR`"],[851,"`hanamori.exe shell init --shell cmd --use-on-cd` selects a project/default toolchain at\nstartup and installs an interactive `cd` DOSKEY macro to reselect after successful directory\nchanges. It replaces an existing `cd` macro. It does not cover `chdir`, `pushd/popd`, drive\nswitches or directory changes inside batch scripts; use `hanamori exec` / `hanamori run`\nfor scripts. Portable `env --shell cmd` entries do not support this option; persistent\ninitialization is required."],[221,"`hanamori.exe shell init --shell cmd --use-on-cd` 可在启动时选择项目或默认工具链，并安装交互式 `cd` DOSKEY 宏，在目录成功变化后重新选择。它会接管已有的 `cd` 宏；仅覆盖交互式 `cd`，不覆盖 `chdir`、`pushd/popd`、直接切换盘符和批处理里的目录切换。脚本请使用 `hanamori exec` / `hanamori run`。便携的 `env --shell cmd` 不支持此选项，必须使用持久初始化。"],[1188,"`hanamori` not found"],[1050,"`host`, `target`"],[430,"`host`、`target`"],[598,"`import --dir NEW --name NAME` 更新原引用"],[196,"`import`"],[828,"`import`"],[212,"`import` 不支持 dry-run；同名导入更新引用。版本查询和安装可能联网；本地管理不自动联网安装。不要假设每个命令都支持 `--json` 或 `--dry-run`。"],[384,"`import` 的 `--name` 必填。命令检查选定组合，只在管理目录的 `references/` 保存路径和实际版本，不修改外部目录。同名引用会更新；移动外部工具链后，以原来的名字重新 import 新路径即可。同一目录的不同组合可以使用不同名字。"],[943,"`info` tracing filter"],[315,"`info` tracing 过滤器"],[128,"`install [VERSION]`"],[760,"`install [VERSION]`"],[990,"`install [VERSION]` accepts an actual MSVC version or numeric prefix, or `latest`.\n`--sdk VERSION` accepts an actual four-part SDK version. `--no-sdk` excludes the SDK and, by default, MSBuild.\n`--toolset-id` and `--sdk-id` explicitly select catalog download IDs and conflict with\ncorresponding actual-version command-line arguments. Package metadata versions are not\nassumed to be compiler directory versions. Remote JSON reports unknown actual versions\nas `null`; it never fabricates a mapping."],[365,"`install [VERSION]` 接受托管目录键、实际 MSVC 版本、数字前缀或 `latest`。`--sdk VERSION` 是实际四段 SDK 版本，`--no-sdk` 排除 SDK，默认也不安装 MSBuild。`--toolset-id` 和 `--sdk-id` 是下载 ID，分别与对应的实际版本命令行参数互斥。"],[1057,"`install` also reads the nearest project. Explicit actual-version/SDK options replace\nthe corresponding project constraint; omitted fields retain it. Explicit download IDs\nsupply payload selection and still must satisfy retained actual-version constraints.\nFor example, a project that pins real versions can be installed using catalog IDs:"],[438,"`install` 同样读取项目文件。显式实际版本/SDK 参数覆盖对应字段，下载 ID 则指定要获取的负载，同时保留项目的实际版本约束："],[717,"`latest` or a version, with an optional `v` prefix"],[86,"`latest` 或指定版本，可带 `v` 前缀"],[586,"`list --json` 查看候选，使用完整托管目录键 或固定别名"],[159,"`list [--json]`"],[791,"`list [--json]`"],[787,"`list-remote --all` groups toolsets and SDKs by VS 2022 and VS 2026, and expands the latest toolset’s packages in each group. It queries release channels by default. Add `--channel preview` (or `insiders`) to query both preview channels instead, without mixing release channels into the result. Identical IDs remain in their source groups. `--all` conflicts with `--vs-version`, `--manifest`, and `--toolset-id`. “All” covers versions still offered by the selected channels for the two supported VS generations, not every historical version Microsoft has ever published."],[988,"`list-remote --all` groups toolsets and SDKs by VS 2022 and VS 2026, and expands the latest toolset’s packages in each group. It queries release channels by default. Add `--channel preview` (or `insiders`) to query both preview channels instead, without mixing release channels into the result. Identical IDs remain in their source groups. `--all` conflicts with `--vs-version`, `--manifest`, and `--toolset-id`. “All” covers versions still offered by the selected channels for the two supported VS generations, not every historical version Microsoft has ever published."],[155,"`list-remote --all` 按 VS 2022、VS 2026 分组列出所选渠道中的工具集和 SDK，并分别展开各组最新工具集的包。默认查询正式渠道；加 `--channel preview`（或 `insiders`）查询两者的预览渠道，不同时混入正式渠道。同名 ID 保留在各自来源组中。它与 `--vs-version`、`--manifest`、`--toolset-id` 互斥。这里的“全部”指当前支持的两代 VS 所选渠道中仍提供的版本，不保证覆盖微软历史上所有已撤下的版本。"],[363,"`list-remote --all` 按 VS 2022、VS 2026 分组列出所选渠道中的工具集和 SDK，并分别展开各组最新工具集的包。默认查询正式渠道；加