_HOME` or `~/.local/share` on Unix). Bash login\nbridges and CMD helper bundles are included. Self uninstall checks the recorded profile block\nor CMD loader ownership before removal and preserves modified entries with a notice. Entries\nwithout ownership records must be removed manually, or registered by\nrerunning `shell init` with the same profile/runtime options first. Manually configured PATH\nentries and Windows uninstall registry entries are not modified. Restart the shell afterward\nto discard its already loaded hook."],[37,"`shell`"],[669,"`shell`"],[1240,"`src/lib/releases.ts` accepts exact named assets from stable releases, distinguishing query errors from unavailable downloads."],[626,"`src/lib/releases.ts` 只接受指定名称的稳定 Release 资产；查询失败与没有匹配资产分开展示。"],[643,"`src/main.rs` parses and exits; `src/cli/` defines the command tree and each command's\narguments; `src/commands/` runs the commands and prints their output. `src/config.rs`\nresolves typed inputs and retains source diagnostics separately. Everything is one\n`hanamori` crate whose top-level modules form layers that only depend downward:"],[10,"`src/main.rs` 负责解析和退出，`src/cli/` 定义命令树和各命令参数，`src/commands/` 执行命令并输出结果，`src/config.rs` 将配置解析成显式类型并保存来源诊断。库的安装选项是显式输入，不自行读取用户全局配置。"],[1068,"`stable` is a local alias you create. Installation does not activate this terminal, and `default` only records a selection. Available versions depend on the chosen catalog."],[448,"`stable` 是你创建的本地别名。安装不会自动激活当前终端，`default` 也只是记录默认选择。最新可用版本取决于所选清单。"],[33,"`state`"],[665,"`state`"],[468,"`tag`"],[1088,"`tag`"],[470,"`target`"],[1090,"`target`"],[424,"`toolset`"],[1044,"`toolset`"],[167,"`unalias NAME`"],[799,"`unalias NAME`"],[200,"`uninstall SELECTOR`"],[389,"`uninstall SELECTOR`"],[832,"`uninstall SELECTOR`"],[1012,"`uninstall SELECTOR`"],[251,"`uninstall`"],[879,"`uninstall`"],[397,"`uninstall` 接受目录键、引用或唯一版本前缀；目标已经缺少文件仍可卸载。目录整体已删除时，使用精确目录键或失效的受管引用也能完成清理。当前会话正在使用目标时先 deactivate；Windows 上取得目录锁后，会通过 Windows Restart Manager 关闭使用目标文件