涵盖这两个工具及其随包 DLL；托管安装缺失这些文件时，重新运行对应的 `install` 可修复。"],[911,"See startup profiles, shell integration and troubleshooting."],[1077,"Select a tag and channel"],[1075,"Select an existing tag, share checks, and publish Windows assets and the crate."],[807,"SELECTOR is a full managed directory key, external reference key (`@NAME`), alias or unique actual-version prefix. Local selection does not accept latest. Without an explicit choice, use the nearest project, then default."],[175,"SELECTOR 是完整托管目录键、外部引用键（`@NAME`）、别名或唯一实际版本前缀。本地选择不接受 latest。无显式选择时使用最近项目，再使用 default。"],[875,"Selectors for `exec --using`, `shell activate`"],[1222,"Self-update"],[1230,"Self-update preserves the running executable architecture: x64 builds select the x64 asset; ARM64 builds select `hanamori-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.exe`, without switching according to OS architecture."],[737,"Self-update supports the Windows x64 / ARM64 MSVC build; a different development target does not establish support for installing native MSVC on that host."],[746,"Self-update uses GitHub API and Release assets with the same proxy configuration, but does not use the toolchain mirror, cache or download directory."],[741,"Separate complete payload caching from resumable download workspaces."],[670,"Sessions, scripts and startup integration"],[798,"Set or query a fixed default installation"],[36,"shell"],[668,"shell"],[522,"Shell"],[752,"Shell commands"],[1115,"Shell detection"],[1192,"Shell detection fails"],[1112,"Shell integration"],[823,"SHELL is powershell, bash, zsh or cmd; omitted values trigger detection. Plain skips detection and conflicts with shell/output. Profile and shell-executable conflict; CMD accepts neither."],[191,"SHELL 为 `powershell`、`bash`、`zsh`、`cmd`；省略时检测调用 Shell。`--plain` 不检测，且与 shell/output 互斥。profile 与 shell-executable 互斥，CMD 均不接受它们。"],[120,"Shell 命令"],[495,"Shell 集成"],[1139,"Shells"],[723,"Skip persistent and current-session PowerShell integration"],[721,"Skip user and process PATH configuration"],